<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Woshetswotsi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Woshetswotsi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Wosheetswots Fino</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wosh.</para>
  <para style="mt">Wosheetswots Fino</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosh nana'úwots fino Luk'as doo shishiyatse tuuka, Mas'aafan b́ kiistsiru keewo Iyesus shuutso shoydek't sha'efwots S'ayin shayiron jisheyat b́ jangosh keewiru dooshishi keewo «Iyerusalemn, Yhud datson, Semariy datson, datsi daarats» (1, 8) doo shishiwo awuk'on bobetsituwok'o keewone, Mas'aafan krstiyani wotar amano ayhudiwotsitse de'e tuur dats jamatsi ash jami imnetiyo b́ wotefetsosh awuk'on b́ gawuntsok'owo keewiruwu taariki mas'aafoniyee. Han guut'tso, krstiyaniwots Roomtso naashi naashonton wed'ewosh gitsotse k'od'o finerawu ashuwotsi bowoterwok'oonat krstiyani imnetiyo ayhudiwots imnetiyo iki s'ayin woshituwo b́wottsok'owo kitsosh ayi nokoreree.</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshetswots fino, Iyesus Krstos jango keewiruwo doo shishiwosh keewets keewo b́ bodts beyokoke úniaawo gawunfere bí'amfook'onat Ik'i moo ned'iyetsok'o golit keez een een kayuwotsi matso falfe.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Krstiyani imnetiyo Iyesus daromaand k'az b́ tuwiyakon Iyerusalemitse dek'tuwetsok'o.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Israe'el dats jamats b́ bodtsok'o.</para>
  <para style="ip">3 Roomno dabdek't Meditraniyi aatsi k'ari gúúratse fa'a datsuwotsatse b́ gawuntsok'o.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosh nanaúwots finotse p'ap'urat be'eyiruwo S'ayin shayiri fintso wotatni P'ent'ek'ost'eyi aawots Iyerusalemitse fa'a amantsuwotsats angnon b́ oot'tsok'o, mank'owere mas'afmanitse ik ikon k'aleets jamwotsitse b́be'etsok'oon S'ayin shayiro krstiyaniwotsnton et boon jishiruwotsi b́ jishiruwok'onat boon b́ kup'irwok'o bíts dab bodek'kiye. Yoots dúr t'iinf teshts krstani wosho k'osh k'osh nabuwotsitse tep'ook'wo araatniye t'inree, woshetswots finotse k'aleets finuwotswere woshman amantsuwots beyonat krstiyaniwots ik wotosh b́ detsts kup'o awuk'o een b́wottsok'oniye bokitsiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Gawu wotosh k'ani dek'i jango 1:1-26</para>
  <para style="io2">A. Iyesus s'uwatse b́ imts tzaziyonat b́ jangits keewon 1:1-14</para>
  <para style="io2">B. Yhud beyok b́shegro bezetso 1:15-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyerusalemitse gawets gawo 2:1—8:3</para>
  <para style="io1">Yhudnat Semaariytse gawets gawo 8:4—12:25</para>
  <para style="io1">P'awlos wosheyat b́fiints fino 13:1—28:31</para>
  <para style="io2">A. Wosheyar sha'a shintso 13:1—14:28</para>
  <para style="io2">B. Iyerusalemitse kakuweetso 15:1-35</para>
  <para style="io2">C. Wosheyar sha'a gitltso 15:36—18:22</para>
  <para style="io2">D. Wosheyar sha'a keezltso 18:23—21:16</para>
  <para style="io2">E. P'awlos Iyerusalemitse, K'isariyitsnat Romitse b́ tipetsok'o 21:17—28:31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk'. 1:1-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Shiimetso Tewofloso!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">T mas'aaf shintsotse Iyesus b́ fintsonat b́danits jamo guut're. T guut'uwe Iyesus b́ fino dek'b́tuwortsoon tuut <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>Daro maantsan b́ tuuts aawo b́ borfetso b́ fintsoniyee, daro maantsan b́ tuwwere gal b́ dek'ts woshetswotssh b́ tzaziyo shayiri S'ayini weeron b́ imihakoniye, <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Ay gond bek'o dek't bí etiyak beyar beetk b́ wottsok'o kitsit weeron ayoto boosh b́ be'eyi, hab aawosh boats be'eyat Ik'i mengst jango boosh b́daniyi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:29">Luk'. 24:29</ref> </char></note> Bonton beyat b́móór hank'o ett boon b́ azazi, «Taa itsh t keewtsok'o nihokere itsh imosh jangiyetso korde'ere bako Iyerusalemitse keshk'ayere, <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk'. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Yoh. 1:33</ref> </char></note> Yohanis aatsone b́gupi, itmo muk' aawoniye okoon shayiri S'ayinon gupetute.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus daro maantsan b́tuwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk'. 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Bowere ikoke ko'edek't bo befere, «Doonzono! n mengsto Isra'elsh aani n imet aawo andeya?» ett boaati.<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Iyesusu hank'o ett boosh bí aaniyi, «Niho b́ took alon bí etts aawonat dúron it danosh falatste. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat. 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar. 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk'. 24:47-48</ref> </char></note> Ernmó shayiri S'ayino itats b́ oot'or ango daatsitute, manoor Iyerusalemn, Yhud dats jamatse, Semariyon, dats daar jamats b́ borfetso taash gawo wotitute.» <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luk'. 24:50-51</ref> </char></note> Hank'owere bí etiyakon bo bek'fere daro maantsan k'az b́ tuwi, dawunonuwere bín dek't bo awatsere ááts b́k'ri.<verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Bíwere daro maantsan b́ tuufere, boowere t'iwints dek't daromandan bo s'iilfere nas' taho tah dek'ts git ashuwots bo ganokere need' dek't, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>«It Galil ashuwotso, eegishe need'dek'at daromatsan it s'iliri? Daro maantsan b́ dek'efere it bek'ts Iyesus haniye, daro maantsan b́ tuufere it bek'tsank'on aanar weetuwe» bo eti. <verse eid="ACT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Maniyere hakon Debrezeyit gurats Iyerusalem maants k'azboaani, Debrezeyit guro Iyerusalematse sanbati aaw sha'ok'oyiye (ik kilometrok'oyiye). <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat. 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar. 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luk'. 6:14-16</ref> </char></note> Iyerusalemits waat bobeef mootse dambani k'aat'ots k'az bokeshi, boowere P'et'rosi, Yohansi, Yak'obi, Indriyasi, Filip'osi, Tomasi, Bert'elemiyosi, Matiwosi, Ilfyos naay Yak'obi, okooretso Simoonnat Yak'ob naay Yhudne. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Jametsanots úniaawo Ik' k'onosh ik nibona bokakuweefo, bontonuwere mááts ik ikuwotsnat Iyesus ind Mariyamn, mank'owere Iyesus eshuwots fa'ano botesh.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Manoor P'et'ros bale hiyo wotitu amants ashuwots taalotse need'dek't hank'o bíeti, <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Ti eshuwotso, Iyesusi detsts ashuwotsi jishtso Yhud jangosh, shin shin shayiri S'ayino Dawit noonon b́ keewtso S'ayin mas'aafi aap' s'eeno geyituwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Yhud noyitsi iko wotat finan noonton finosh taaweytniye b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mat. 27:3-8</ref> </char></note> Ernmó ashaan b́ gond finon b́ daatsts gizmann datso keew b́dek'i, b́ baron diht gúp'unat b́ taalon kap'eyat bí anzro k'az b́keshi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Keewanuwere Iyerusalemitse fa'a jamwotssh b́ daneyi, mansh datsmanúwere bo nooni keewon ‹Akeldama› et s'egeyi, b́ bitsonuwere ‹S'ats datsa› etee.<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:25">Dub. 69:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109:8</ref> </char>
    </note> «Man b́ wottsonuwere dub mas'aafotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‹B́beyoko dats baash wotowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Konuwor bíyats beek'aye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Aaninuwere b́ naashts naasho k'osh asho bíyatse de'ewutsowe›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Ett guut't teshetsotsnee.<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>«Eshe Doonzo Iyesus nodagotse bí ananori noonton towat teshtswotsitse, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar. 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:19">16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk'. 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">24:51</ref> </char></note> Mank'o Yohans guproon tuut doonzo Iyesus daromaants b́ tuufetsi aawosh noonton teshtswotsitse ash iko noonton k'irotse tuwi jango gawo b́ woto geyituwe.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Maniyere hakon git ashuwotsi bo t'intsi, boowere Bersabasi wee Iyost'osi eteefo Yosefnat Matiyasna botesh.<verse eid="ACT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Hank'o ettnuwere Ik'o bok'oni, «Ash jami nibo dants doonzono! Gitetsanotsitse nmarat'tso aawi b́ woto noosh kitsuwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Nok'onirwonwere Yhud b́ tookon k'az bíamori k'azb́k'rts wosheetsots finan de'er b́ shaato shegrshosh wotituwo noosh nkiitsishee.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>It'onowere bo shap'i Matiyassh b́ keshi, Mansh bí tatse ik woshetswotsnton b́ taaweyi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danifuwotsats S'ayin shayiro b́ oorshtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lew. 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Iwi. 16:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> P'ent'e k'ost'eyi baaliyi aawa eteetso b́ bodtsok'on bo jametsuwots ik wotdek't ikoke kakuwedek'tni botesh, <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Gawerawo eegurahi kup'ok'o arts k'aaro darotse b́weyi, bítse bo beyiru moonowere s'een b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Taaw laluw artso boats bobe'eyi, kaye kayeyatnúwere bo ik ikotsats k'ot'bodek'i. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Jamwotswere shayiri S'ayinon bo s'eeni, Shayiri S'ayinon bo keewituwok'o boosh b́ imtsok'on k'osh k'osh noonon keewo dek't botuwi.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Dats jamatse beyir datsatse waatsuwots, Ik' k'onon kup'iru ayhudiwots Iyerusalemitsa bobeefo. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>K'áármano bo shishtsok'on ayi ashuwots bo ko'eyi, bo took took nononowere bokewufere bo shishtsotse bo'adi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Tek'at adtnuwere hank'o bo eti, «Hank'o keewiru jamanots Gelil dats ash nosha? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Eshe no nó took noonon keewo bokeewefere noshishir aawuk'oneya? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>No P'arteen, Miedn, Elamn, Mesp'et'omin, Yhdon, K'op'dok'n, P'ant'osn, Isiyon, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Frgiyoon, P'nfiliyon, Gbs'n, K'eren ganoke fa'úwots Libiyi awurajuwotsitse beyiruwotsiye, Romitse waats ayhudiyotsnat ayhudiwots jiro maantso kindtsowots daatseyiruwone, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Mank'owere K'ert'esitsnat Araawi dats ashuwots daatsetune, Hamb jamanots Ik'o een fino nononon bo keewufere shishiruwonee!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Mann jametswots adt bo keewituwo t'ut't iko ikosh «Keewan eebiye k'úna b́wotiti!» bo et.<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>K'oshuwotsmó «Weyiniyon dutsets biri handro úsht mashwutsernee!» eton boon boaatsni.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros keewts keewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Manoor P'et'ros tatse ikuwotsnton need'dek't b́ k'aaro eenshdek't ash ashosh hank'o ett b́ keewi, «It Yhud dats ashuwotsnat Iyerusalemn beyiru jametsuwotso, wotts keewan danosh tkeewo k'ewere, <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Guuron keez sa'ato b́wottsotse it it aasabtsok'o ashaanots masheratsnee. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Ernmó han b́wotiye Nebiyiyo Iyu'el hank'o et b́ keewuts keewo b́ s'eenishe,<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Iyu. 2:28-32</ref> </char>
    </note> ‹Ik'oniye dúri s'uwi aawots hank'o wotituwe etre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">T Shayiro ash jamats kut'ituwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Bo nungushnana'onat mááts nana'uwotsn bek'on keewitunee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Bo jawetswotswere bek'o bek'etune.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Bo eenashuwotswere gúmo gumetunee.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Mank'o, manoori aawumanotsitse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">T guuts nungushuwotsnat máátsuwots atsats</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">T shayiro kut'ituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Bowere bek'on keewitunee.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Danbe darotse adits keewwotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Dashe datsatse adits milkituwotsi kitsituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">S'atso, taawo, s'uwi s'aawiyonuwere be'etuwe.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Eenonat aditso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Doonzo aawo b́waafetsere shino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Aawo t'aluwituwee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Aashitsunuwere s'atso arituwanee.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Doonzo shútso s'eegetu jamo kashituwe.›<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>«Israe'el ashuwotso! aap'an k'ewude'ere, It it tookon it dantsok'on Nazrettso Iyesus koni b́wottsok'o Ik'o it dagotse b́weeron b́ k'alts een een finwotsi, aditsuwotsnat milikituwots arikon daneewtsernee. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:37">Mat. 27:37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar. 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk'. 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Yoh. 19:18</ref> </char></note> Bíwor b́ tookon Ik'o shin shino b́ k'anitsok'onat b́dants finok'on itsh besheyat bí imeyi. It were morrgonduwots kishon jiteyar b́k'irituwok'o it woshi. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Ik'onmó k'iri angotse farit k'irotse bín b́ tuuzi mansh k'iro bín deshde oriyo falrtsatse. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Dawit b́ jangosh hank'o etfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">Doonzo úni aawo tshinatse bek'iruwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">T shek'erawok'owere bí t k'ani aaratse<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Manshe tnibo geneeúwre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">T nononwere geneeúwone s'eene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Mank'owere tmeetsonú kótón jangáár beetuwe.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>T kashunowere Si'olitse k'ayk'reratsnee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">N S'ayinonowere dowootse o'or b́ oorituwok'o woshratsnee.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-28 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Dub. 16:8-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Kashi weeronowere taash danirne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Taanton nwottsonowere t geneúwo s'een wotituwe.»<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>«Eshuwotso! yoots nihiwotsitsi iko Dawit b́ k'irtsok'onat b́ duketsok'on, b́ dowonuwere andish b́ borfetso noganok b́ fa'ok'owo kishde itsh keewuna. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Dub. 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref> </char></note> Ernmó Dawit han b́ keewiye Nebiyo b́ teshtsotsnat Ik'o nnaarotse iko n naashi jorats beezituwe ett taaron jangit b́imts keewo b́ dantsotsne. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Manatse tuutson Mesiyo Siolitse b́ oorerawok'onat b́ meetsonuwere o'or b́ oorerawok'o shin shino k'irotse b́tuwi jango b́keewi. <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Iyesusi Ik'o k'irotse tuuzre, no noúnetswor keewansh gaw noone. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Ik'o k'ani aaromants beyosh danbaan b́tuwooronat jangiyets S'ayin shayiro Nihoke b́ dek'tsok'on it bek'iruhannat it shishiruwann kuut'b́k'ri. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34-35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34-35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char></note> Eshe dambaan daromantsan keshtso Dawiti b́ woterawotse Dawiti b́tookon hank'o ett keewre,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34-35">‹Doonzo t doonzsh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">N balangarwotsi ntufishirots tgerfetsosh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">T k'ani aaromants beewe› » etre.<verse eid="ACT 2:34-35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>«Eshe it itjittso Iyesusi Ik'o Doozonat Mesiyo b́ woshtsok'owo Israe'el ash jamo arikon dan de'e!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Ashuwotswere man bo shishitsok'oon bonibotse ayidek' shiyanat P'et'rosnat k'osh woshetswotssh, «No eshuwotso! eshe and eege nok'aliti?» boeti.<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>P'et'rosuwere hank'o boosh bíeti, «Naandrone erere, it morro itsh orowa eteyish it ik ikets Iyesus Krstos shútson gupewere, Ik'i imtso Shayiri S'ayinono dek'etute <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>B́ jangiyets aap'onwere itnat it nanaúwotssh, no Doonz Izar Izewer b́ maantsan b́ s'eegetu wokoon beyiru jamwotsshe.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>K'osh k'osh ay keew keewon gawefetst «K'uur s'oot'anats weet fayotse it tooko kashiwere!» ett boon b́ izi. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Boyitse ayuwots b́ aap'tso dek't bogupeyi, manots aawotsowere keez kumok'o wotitwots amantsuwotsats dabebowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Bowere wosheetsots daniyo k'ebon, ikwotde beyonowere, Mishi maratse towaat moonat Ik'o k'ononowere bokup'efooni.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' Amantsuwots Eshu Wotonat Ik Wotde'er Beyi jango.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Manoor wosheetsots kishon ayo adits keewonat milikitwots bo fineyiruwatse tuutson jametsatse shato oot' b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 4:23-35">Wosh. 4:23-35</ref> </char></note> Amants jamwots ikwotde'erni bobeefon boteshi, Bo detsts keewu jamononwere shira b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Bo taaronat bo detstso kemdek't b́ gizo jametsosh b́geytsok'on bokayifooni. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Aawu aawon Ik'i mootsnowere ik nibona bokakuweefo, bomaa mootsnowere misho tishfetsr geneeúwonat nib sheengona bomaafoni botesh. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Doonzonowere bo udefoni, ash jamonuwere boon mangiya b́mangifo, Ik'onuwere kashiru ashuwotsi aaw aawon boyits daba b́dabfo.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ash duro b́kashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Ik aawu P'et'rosnat Yohansn Ik' k'oneef sa'aton aawitsi jed'i sa'aton Ik'moots boami, <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Manoknowere «Sheenga» err s'eegef fengesh iko fa'e b́tesh, b́shuwertson tuut dúr wottso ash iko ashaashwots aawu aawon de'ewaar manok ger bok'rofo, bí manoke bede'er Ik' moots kindiru ash ashaatse gizo b́ k'onfoni. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Ash han P'et'rosnat Yohansn Ik'i moots bokindfere bek't ms'uwatiyo booke b́k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Bowere ashman t'iwintsdek't s'iilt boere P'et'ros «Nomaants s'iile!» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Bíwere booke ik jago b́ daatsituwok'o bí arere boon t'iwintsdek't b́ s'iili. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>P'et'rosmó «Ambaaronat awntson deshatse, t detstsonmó neesh imetuwe, Nazrettso Iyesus Krstos shúútson tuur sha'owe!» bí et. <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>B́ k'ani kishonowere detsdek't tuuz b́k'ri, Manoor b́ tufonat b́ mak'tsi gimbon kup'b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Jobk' ettnuwere need'b́dek'i, Sha'eferowere bonton Ik'i moots b́ kindi, shaawefetst t'oolefetstnuwere Ik'o udi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Ash jamonuwere sha'efetst Ik'onowere b́ udefere bobek'i. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>«Sheeng fengesha» ett s'eegef Ik'i maa fengeshi ganoke bedek't giz k'onfo bí b́ wottsok'o danbok'ri, Bíyatsno wotts keewatse tuutson ayidek't adt dok etbowtsi.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros Ik'i mootse b́keew keewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Kashts ashman P'et'rosnat Yohansn atse k'aleratse ett detsdek't b́befere ash asho adt «Solomon ananefoka» eteef beyokoke bo maants wos'fere boami. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>P'et'rosuwere ashuwotsi b́ bek'tsok'on boosh hank'owa bíet, Israe'el ashuwotso! Keewanatse tuutson eegoshe it adiri? Noon eegoshe t'iwints dek'at its'iliri? Noo no took kup'on wee noo sheeng fino nofiintsatse tuutson ashaan b́ sha'ituwok'o no k'altsok'o arefa itsha? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kesh. 3:15</ref> </char></note> No nihotsko, Abrahamko, Yisahak'ko, Ya'ak'obko Izar Izewer b́ naayi Iyesusi mangire, ernmó it bín P'ilat'os shinatse beshidek'at it imi, P'ilat'osuwere dab bín fakshk'ro b́ geere geeratsone it eti. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat. 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar. 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk'. 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Yoh. 19:12-15</ref> </char></note> It S'ayinonat kááwu finetso geeratsone etaat kash údts iko itsh b́bitsetuwok'o it k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Kash imts wottsonowere it úd'i, Ik'onmó k'irotse bín b́ tuuzi, keewansh noo gawu noone. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>It bek'iruwonat it dants ashaan kashat b́ kup'iye Iyesus shúútson daatsets imnetiyone, Iyesus shútson bí amantsatse tuutsonowere it únets shinatse s'een wotts jeeno daatsre.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>«Andoor ti eshuwotso! it woor iti jishiruwotskok'o daron it k'altsok'o danfee <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Ik'onmó shinshin b́ nebiyi jametswots noonon ‹Krstos gond bek'o daatso bín geyife› ett bíaap'ts aap'o hank'on b́s'eentsi. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Eshe it morro itatse b́ t'afitwok'o naandrone err Doonzo maantsan aanoore. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Ik'oke it handrit dúro itsh wetuwee, Ik'o shin itsh b́ marat'tso Krstos Iyesusi itsh woshituwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Bí darotse b́ teshet Ik'o shin bík S'ayin nebiyiwots noonon b́ keewtsok'on dats jamo bí handrefetsoshee. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Iwi. 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18">18</ref> </char></note> Musewere hank'o etre, ‹Doonzo Izar Izewer taan b́ tuuztsok'on mank'o it eshuwotsitse Nebiyiyo itsh tuuzituwe, bí itsh b́ keewitu jamo k'ewere, <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Iwi. 18:19</ref> </char></note> Nebiyiman k'ewawu jamo ashotse k'aleyar b́ jamon t'afituwe.› <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Manats dabt Samu'el dúrtson teshts nebiyi jamwots, dúran jango mank'o keewurne. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Aze. 22:18</ref> </char></note> It nebiyiwotsi naatetuwots itne, mank'o Ik'o Abrahamsh ‹ash jamwots nnaaron deretúne› ett nonihotsnton b́ kindts taaro naatetuwots itne. <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Mansh Ik'o b́guutso b́ wosh shin shino itshee b́ teshi, man b́ k'aluwere it ik ikon it took gond weeratse aanar it eree iti b́deerishe.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">P'et'rosnat Yohansn ayhudiwots moosh mooshif jebats bot'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>P'et'rosnat Yohansn ash ashosh keewoke bobefere kahniwotsnat Ik'i maa kotfuwotsatsi naashosh aaninuwere Seduk'awiwots bomaants waat <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Wosheets gitetsúwots Iyesus k'irotse b́ tuwo ash ashosh bodanitsonat k'irtsuwots k'irotse botwitwok'owo kish bokeewutsotse bofayi. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Mansh boon dets bodek'iyakon datso ilat b́teshtsotse yaatsish b́ borfetsosh tipimoots boteshetuwk'o bok'ali. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Ernmó bokeewuts keewo k'ebts ashuwotsitse ayuwots amanerno, amants ashuwots taawonwere úts kumo maants dambaan b́ t'iini.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Yaats guurok'on Ayhudi naashuwotsnat eenashuwotsn, Muse nemo danifwotswere Iyerusalemits kakuwe bowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Kahniwots naasho Hananat K'eyafn, Yohansnat Indriyasn, Kahni maa naashwotsatsi k'aabo jag jamwots fa'ano, <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Bowere wosheets gitetsuwotsi botaalotse need'idek't, «Han it k'al eegi angoneyamó kon shútsoneya?» ett boon boaati.<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Manoor P'et'ros S'ayin shayiron s'eent hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «It ash ashaatse naashtswotsonat eenashwotso! <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Noo hambets no aateyirwo ash dúr ikosh k'aleets sheeng keewonat awuk'on b́ kashtsok'oniyee. <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>Ashaan kashat it shinatse b́ need'ir, it it jiire Ik'onmó k'irotse b́ tuuztso Nazrettso Iyesus Krstos shútson b́ wottsok'o it únetsnat Israe'el ash jamo dane. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Dub. 118:22</ref> </char></note> It gimbi agfwots gac'at it juuts shútso bí nee, ernmó bí gimbiman tungúshatse shútswotsi kaatsde detset shúts eeno wotere. <verse eid="ACT 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Mansha kasho bína bako k'oshon konnor aaliye, noo bín nokashish geyitso Ik'o ashuwotssh b́ imts shútso bíyere okoon dats jamatse konwor aaliye.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>P'et'rosnat Yohansn aawshuk'on bokeewtsok'o moosh mooshiyruwots bos'iltsok'on danaawonat daneraw ash bowoto bo dantsotse bo'adi, Iyesusntonwere bo teshtsok'o danbodek'i. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Kashts ashonwere bonton b́ned'efere bo bek'tsosh boatsats bokeewituwo bot'ut'i. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Mansha moosh mooshifwotsoke úromaants bokeshetwok'o azazat muk'i boteshiyakon hank'o ett boshiyeyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>«Eshe ashaanotsatse eeg k'aluwono? Adits keewi enan bo kishon b́ fiinetsotse Iyerusalemitse beyiru jamwotsoke danere, mansh keewan haalo falatsonee. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Ernmó ash jamoke ayefere bíamawok'o hanyahak Iyesus shúútso s'eer konshor bo keewurawok'o ‹it atso korde'ere› erone.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Manihak s'eegdek't Iyesus shúútso s'eer b́ jamon bodanirawok' kup'idek't boon boazazi. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>P'et'rosnat Yohansnmó hank'o et boosh boaaniyi, «Ik'osh aleyoniyere itsh aleyo Ik'i shinatse wotituwaa? Aab it it tookonor angshwere. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Nooyere nobek'tsonat noshishtson keewo fal k'ayatsone.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Ash ashuwotsatsi naashwotsnat moosh mooshifwots P'et'rosnat Yohansn awuk'on bo fayitwok'o weero t'ut't, ashuwots boshattsotse aaniy sheefat faksh bok'ri, man bok'aluwere ashuwots wotts keewumantse tuutso Ik'o bo udtsosha b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Adits keewann kashts ashman bí idmeyo hab natoniyere bogka b́ tesh.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woshetswotsnat amantsuwotsn gishewor Ik' bok'ontsook'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>P'et'rosnat Yohansn faksh k'rere bo toohuwotsok boaantsok'on kahniwotsatse naashuwotsnat eenashuwotsn boosh boetts jamo bokeewi. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kesh. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh. 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Dub. 146:6</ref> </char></note> Bowre man boshishtsok'on, ik wotdek't bok'aaro eenshdek't Ik'o maants hank'o ett bokuhi, «Daro, datso, aatsk'aro, boyitse fa'a jamo aztso Doonz eenono! <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>S'ayin shayiron n guutso no nihi Dawit noonon hank'o etaat keewtso neene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‹Ik' ash woterawwots eegishe bo shashiri?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Ashuwots eegishe gond finosh datsmec'ron bo k'úmiri?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25-26 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Dub. 2:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> Datsatsi naashwots matseedekt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Dats k'ezirwots ik wotdek't ko'edek't,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Doonzonat b́ Mesihiyo ats bo tuwi.›<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk'. 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:11">7:11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Yoh. 18:28-29</ref> </char>
    </note> «Aron Hirodisnat P'ent'os datsatsi asho P'ilat'os Ik' ash woterawwotsnat Israe'el ashuwotsn kitots ko'edek't nfuuttso S'ayin guutso Iyesus ats botuwi, <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Hank'o b́ wotiye nee shino niangonat ntook shunon n beezts fino s'eetsoshe, <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Doonzono!, andoor bo sheefirwan s'iile, n guutsuwots bosharaniye aawo shu'ude n aap'o bokewituwok'o woshuwe, <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>N guuts S'ayino Iyesus shútson shodtswots bo kashitwok'onat adits, een een keewwots bo wotitwok'o n kisho jargwe.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Ik' k'ono bo ishiyakon ko'edek't bo beyiruwok man shek'e b́wutsi, jamwotswere shayiri S'ayinon s'een bowutsi, Ik'i aap'onwre ááwu shuk'on keewo dek't botuwi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shin shni amantsuwots detstso shir b́teshtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Wosh. 2:44-45</ref> </char>
    </note> Amants jamwots ik nibonat ik maac'on detsfno bo tesh, konuworu ash iko, «Haniye tikee» bí eteet keewo deshatse b́ tesh, bo dagotsere jam keewo bo jamets shira b́ teshi, <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Woshetswotswere Doonzo Iyesus k'irotse tuwi jango angi eenona bogawefo, jametswotsatsno Ik' s'aati eeno fa'e b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Datso wee moowo detsts jamwotswere kem dek't b́ gizman dek't boweyiruwotse boyitse konworu t'ut'tso aali b́ tesh. <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>Gizmano dek'wat woshetswotssh im bok'refoni. Bo ik iketssh boosh b́ geyitsok'owa kay bodek'foni.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>K'op'rsn shuwetso, Yosefi eteetso Lewawi iko fa'e b́ teshi, wosheetswotsu «Barnabasi» ett bo s'eegfoni, b́ bitsonuwere «Kup'shit na'a» etee. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Bíwere b́ datso kemt b́ gizo dek'wat woshetswotssh b́ imi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Hananinat Sep'irna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Hnaniyi eteef asho b́ máátsu Sep'iri eteetsunton datso bokemi, <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>B́ máátsunu b́ danfere dats kemeets gizotse k'atso oorik'rat k'atsonmó dek' waat woshetswotssh imb́k'ri, <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>P'et'rosmó bísh hank'owa bí'et, «Hee Ananaiyo! S'ayin shayirats korr datso kemeets gizotse nooridek'etwok'o n nibots Shed'ano eegishe b́ kindi? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>N kemftsere shino datsman nikoshna b́ teshi? N kemiyakonor gizo nikoshna b́ teshi? Eshe, keewan eegoshe n nibots n gawi? N kootiye Ik'atsa bako ashaatsaliyee.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Hananiyi b́ keewts keewuman b́ shishtsok'on diht b́ k'iri, keewuman shishts ash jamo ayidek't shatbowtsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Jawetswotsu b́ duuno k'oddek't dek'amt duukbok'ri.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Keez sa'atonire okoon Hananiyi máátsu b kenihats bodts keewo b danawo waa bkeshi. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>P'et'rosuwere «Aab taash keewwe it datso it keemts k'awuntso hank'one?» bish bíet. Biwere «Ee! Mank'o gizoshe?» bi'et.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Manoor P'et'ros, «Ik'i Shayiri S'ayino fadosh aawuk'oneya ik it woti? Hamb! nkenihi duukt aaniru ashuwots fengeshatsnee, Nenowere de'amr duuketunee» bí et. <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Biwere manoor b́ tufishroots dihat k'irbwutsi, Jawetswotswere bokindtsok'on k'irgutsat b befere daatst dek'amt b kenih ganok duukbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Ik' mootsi ash ash jamona et keewan shishtsuwots ayidek shato wotb́wtsi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wosheetswots kishatse wotts milikituwotsnat adits keewwotsn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Adits keewu ayuwotsnat milikituwotsn wosh etsúwots kishona bofinefo b́tesh, jametsuwotswere ik nibon wotde'er Selemon dada etefokna bokakuwefoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Bonton woterawo ikonuwor dab bonton wotosh ááwu shuuk'fo aali b́ tesh, b́ woteferor ash jamo boon mangya bo mangifoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Doonzono! amaniru máátsonat nungushwots botaawo ayidek't ayefera bíamfoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Ash ashuwots shodets ayuwotsi weromantsana kishde'er es'onat she'ats bok'eezfoni, mank'o bok'alirwere P'et'ros man weeron b́beshoor b́ s'ilalo dab́ ik iketsuwotsats b́bodishee. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Ash asho Iyerusalem gúúratse fa'a kitwotsitse shoodetsonat kim shayiron gondo bek'irwotsi de'erni bowaafo, jametswotswere kasha bokashefo.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wosheetswots gishewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Kahni naashwotsatsi k'aabonat bínton teshts Seduk'awino eteefuwots jirwots bojamets okooron s'eent boatsats botuwi, <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Woshetswotsi detsdek't tipimoots kindsh bok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Melakiwotsmó t'ú tipi maa fengesho k'eshdek't boon kishbok'ri, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«Ameree! Ik'i mootse need'de'er kashi keewo detsts keewan ash jamosh keewwere!» boosh bíeti, <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Woshetswotswere b́ tzaziyo dek't guuron Ik'i moowots kindek't daniyo dek't botuwi. Manoor Kahani naashwotsatsi k'aabonat bínton beyirwots wáát mooshiru jirwotsnat Ayhudi eenashts jamwots ikok ko'ebowutsi, ashuwots woshetsauwotsi de'er bowetuwok'o tipi moowo maantsan bowoshi. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Woshetswotswere tipi moo maantsan wáát woshtsuwotsi bítse daatsratsno, aanat waatnuwere, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>«Tipi maa fengsho kup'shdek't is'etsok'on, kotiruwotsuwere b́ fengshatse need'dek't bokotfere nodaatsi, tipi maa is'o nok'sheoromó eegoru bítse datsatsone» ett bokeewi. <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Ik'i moo kotirwotsi jishruwonat Kahanati naashuwots n han boshishor «Eebi keewan naaroni?» ett daand bowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Manoor ash iko wáát «Tipi moots it gedts ashuwots hamb́, Ik'i mootse need'dek'tniye ashuwotsi bodaniri» ett boosh b́ keewi. <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Manoor Ik'i maa kotiruwotsi jishiruwonat bínton beyiru ashuwotsnton amt boon dek't boweyi, bodoowuwere angnon b́woteraniye dashdek'tniye, han bok'aliye ashuwots boon shútson bojod'awok'o shatniye.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Woshetswotsno dek'wat mooshiyruwots shinat bot'intsi, kahani naashonuwere hank'o ett boon bí aati, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat. 27:25</ref> </char></note> «Iyesus shútso s'eer it danirawok'o itn kup'shdek'at azazerone b́teshi, ernmó hamb, Iyerusalemi it daniruwon s'entsk'rerte, itmo ash man k'irotse no aatetuwok'o woshoshe itgeyri.»<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>P'et'rosnat woheets k'oshuwotsn hank'o et boaaniyi, «Ashosh aleyoniyere Ik'osh aleyo noosh geyife, <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>No nihotsko Izar Izewer it mitats jittdek'at it úd'tso Iyesusi k'irotse tuuz b́k'ri, <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Ik'o Israe'el ash ashosh naandre etonat bomorrosh oorowe eto b́ imetuwok'o Iyesusi jishiruwonat woritson woshdek't b́ k'ani aaromants mangon b́ beetuewk'o woshre, <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Keewu man jangosh noo gawunone, Ik'o bísh aleets jamwotssh b́ imts S'ayin shayiro gawe.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Moosh mooshiyruwots man bo shishtsok'on ayidek't fayat woshetswotsi úd'o bogeyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Ernmó ash ashoke mangiyetsonat Muse nemo danik wottso Gemaliyali eteets ferisawi wotat moosh mooshif iko tuut woshetswotsi múk' gizewosh úromaantsan bo kishituwok'o boon bíazazi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Manoor mooshiru jirwotssh hank'owa bíet, «Israe'el ashuwotso! Ashaanotsats it k'aliru keewosh it atso korde'ere. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Haniye shin Tewodasi eteets asho ‹Taahe ash een taane› ett tuure b́ teshi, awd balok'o ashonwere bínton ik woterne bo teshi, ernmó bín úd'niyek'reyi, b́ shuutso shairwotsuwere bad' bowutsi, bí'ettsonuwere shiro boraniyere b́ oori. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Maniyere hakon ash ashuwotsi taawets dúron Geliltso Yhud tuwut ay ashuwots b́shuutso bosha'itwok'o b́ woshi, bínowere úd'eyi, b́ shuuts sha'irwotswere bad'e bobad'i <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Mansh and taa itsh tietirwo it ashaanotsoke wokar boon k'ay it k'rituwok'owe, asaabiyan wee finan ashoke waaka wotiyal t'afitkee. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Ik'oke waaka wotiyalmó boon t'afiyosh falratste, Ikinuwor Ik'onton fayeye itsh wotitwe.» Bowere Gemalyal iztso bodek'i.<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Maniyak woshetswotsi bo maants s'eegdek't bojot'iyi, Iyesus shútsonowere s'eer bokeewrawok'o azazat faksh bok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Woshetswotsmó Iyesus shútsi jangosh keteyo boosh b́geyitwok'o bodantsotse gene'úwefetst mooshi jeboke kesht boami, <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Aawu aawon Ik'i moonat maa mootsnowere Mesihiyo Iyesus jango daniyonat doo shishi keewo ned'iratsno boteshi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Shawat dak'oniwotsi galdek'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Múk'i boteshtsok'on, amantsuwots taawo ayefere bí amee Grik dats noon keewo keewiru ayhudiwots Yhud datsatse shuwets ayhudiwotsats mumundo dek't botuwi, bomumundiruwere aaw aawon bokenih k'irts maatsuwotssh kayiyeyiruwo batk'o bobatefosha b́ tesh. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Mansh tatse git wosheetsots amants jametsuwotsi kakuk'raat boosh hank'o boet, «Mish kayiyosha err Ik'o aap' daniyifino k'azo noosh geyiratse. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Eshe eshuwotso! bosheeng doyon udetswotsi, S'ayin shayironat danon s'eents shawat ashuwotsi ititse geyore, bonowere finanats naashiwonee. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Noomó Ik'o k'ononat Ik'o aap'o daniwosh kup'ituwonee.»<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Bo ettsan jamwotsi b́ geneúshi, ashaanotsnowere galbodek'i, boowere imnetiyonat S'ayin shayiron s'eentso Ist'ifanosi, Filip'osi, P'rokorosi, Nik'arona, Timona, P'ermena Ayhudi imnetiyo dek't teshtso Ans'okiyi datsatstso Nik'olawosiye. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Hanotsi wosheetsots shinats need'i bok'ri, woshetswotsuere Ik'o bok'oniyakon bo kishonowere boats bogedi.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Hank'on Ik' aap'o gawunfere bíamtsotse, Iyerusalemitsi amantsuwots taawo ayidek't ayefere bíamtsotse Kahanatiwotsitsnowere ay wottswots bo amani.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Diyak'oniyo Ist'ifanosi b́detseetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Ist'ifanos Ik' s'aatonat angon s'eent adits keewuwotsnat een een milikituwotsi ash ashuwots dagotse b́ k'aliri b́ teshi, <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Manoor, «Nas' kishitu ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni maa» eteets ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni moowotse ashuwots K'erennat Iskndriyas ashuwots, Kilk'iyanat Isiyi datsatatse ik ik ashuwots tuut Ist'ifanosi k'efoon bo mooshfere boteshi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Ernmó Ist'ifanos bín b́ keewiru dani telefo S'ayin shayiro bísh b́ imk b́wotsotse bísh aaniyo falratsno botesh. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Manoor ashaan, «Muse nat Ik'ats c'ashi aap'o b́ keewfere shishrone» eteet ashuwotsi degon bí ats tuuz bok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Mank'oon ash ashonat eenashuwotsn Muse nemo danifuwotsnowere bíyatsats tuuz bok'ri, Ist'ifanosokowere amt detsdek't moosh mooshiyiruwots shinats bín t'intsbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Bíyats kooton gaawit ash ik ikuwotsnowere dek'tboweyi, kooton gawituwotswere hank'o boeti, «Ashaan Ik'i mannat Muse nemo jamawa b́ c'ashfo. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Aaninuwere ‹Nazrettso Iyesus Ik'i man gaketuwe, Muse noosh b́ beshits teronowere woniyituwe› ett b́ keewufere shishrone.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Manoor mooshi jebatse fa'a jamwots Ist'ifanosi t'iwintsdek't bos'ile b́ shiitso melaki shitsok'o araat boosh b́ be'eyi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ist'fanos keewuts keewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Kahniwotsatsi naasho Ist'fanossh, «Eteets keewan arikeya?» eton bíaati.<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Ist'fanosuwere hank'o ett bísh bíaniyi, «Ti eeshuwotsnat tnihotso! aab taan k'ewere! Nonih Abraham Karan datsatse beyosh bíamfetsre shino shin Mesp'et'omiya eteets datsatse b́ befere Mangts Ik'o bísh be'eyat <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2-3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Aze. 12:1</ref> </char></note> ‹N datsatse keer, n jagatse k'alyarr, taa neesh t kitsit datsats amee› bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Aze. 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">12:4</ref> </char></note> Manoor Keledawiyots datsatse kesht Karani eteets datsats be b́wtsi, b́ nih b́k'irihakonowere Ik'o Karanitse kisht hambets it beyiru datsanats bín dek'et b́weyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Wotowabako dab tufi need'okok'o bodts rstiyo bísh imatse, b́wotefere datsani bínat bíyere il b́ naarosh rstiyo woshde'er b́imetuwok'o taarre b́teshi, bísh b́taaruwere Abraham na'o b́ detsfetsere shine. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Aze. 15:13-14</ref> </char></note> B́ naaronuwere ash datsatse gooshtsi wotar b́beetuwok'o datsmanatsnowere awd bal natosh guuts woshde'er was'o kayde'er boon bokewituwok'o bísh keewure b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kesh. 3:12</ref> </char></note> Manats dabtnwere, ‹Guuts woshde'er b́ keewit ashuwotsats angshitwe, datsmanatse keer hanoke taan ik'itúne› ett Ik'o keewre. <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Aze. 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">21:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:26">25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:31-35">29:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18">18</ref> </char></note> Gof ami taaronowere bísh bími, mansha Abraham Yishak'i b́shuwor shimtl aawots gofo b́daamiyi, Mank'o b́ naayi Yisak'i gofo b́daamiyi. Yak'obuwere b́ jir tatse gitetsuwotsi gofo b́damyi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>«Yak'ob nanaúwots bo eshuwi Yosefi okoort Gbs' datsatsere guutso b́ wotituwok'o bokemi, Ik'onmó bíntoniye b́ teshi, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 37:11">Aze. 37:11</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:2">39:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref> </char></note> Gond bek' jamotse bín b́ kishi, Gbs' naasho Fer'on shinatsere baatsonat danitelefo bísh bi'imi. Naashonuwere Gbs'nat b́ maa jamatse alituwo bín b́woshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 42:1-2">Aze. 42:1-2</ref> </char></note> Manór Gbs'nat Kene'an dats jamatse ayidek't ash kic'its k'ak'i eeno b́ woti, no nihuwotsuwere misho daatsosh falatsne. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Ya'ak'obwere Gbs'itse mááyo b́ beyok'owo b́ shishtsok'on tuwreerosh nonihotsi manok b́ woshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Aze. 45:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 16">16</ref> </char></note> Aani gitlo aanat Gbs'i bo amor Yosef b́ eshuotsesh b́ tooko b́ daneyi, jag bowotonúwere Fere'onokere b́ daneyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-10">Aze. 45:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:17-18">17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref> </char></note> Maniye hakon Yosef b́ nihi, Yak'obnat b́ jag jamo b́mandan dek't b́weyi, bo bojametsuwre shabe úts ashno. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Mansh Yak'ob Gbs' maantsan bí ami, bínat no nihwotsn manoke bok'iri. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Aze. 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 24:32">24:32</ref> </char></note> Bomak'tsonowere Sekem maantsan dek'amt Abraham Sekemn Emor nan'úwotsoke b́ gizon b́keewts doowots dukeyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>Ik'o Abrahamsh taart b́ jangitso wotit aawo b́ t'inor Gbs'n beyiru ashuwots taawo ayefere bí ami. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17-18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 1:7-8">Kesh. 1:7-8</ref> </char></note> Man b́ wotwere Yosefi danawo k'osh Nugúso Gbs'n b́ naashefetsoniye. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 1:10-11">Kesh. 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22">22</ref> </char></note> Handr naash manuwere no ashuwotsats gondo k'úmt no nihwotsats kic'iyo dek't bo tuwi, bo nana'i marmat'uwotsno bok'irituwok'o úratse kishde'er bo juwituwok'o, no nihuwotsi bokic'iyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kesh. 2:2</ref> </char></note> Manór Muse b́ shuweyi, bíwere Ik'i shinatse na'i az sheenge b́teshi, keez shashonowre b́nihi meyitse b́ eeni, <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Kesh. 2:3-10</ref> </char></note> Uratso juu k'irewor Fereon mááts naú k'audekat b́ naayik'o woshdek'at b ditsi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Musewwere Gbs' datsi dani teleef jamo danb́dek'i, b́ keewiru keewonat b́ finonowere kup' wotb́wtsi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Kesh. 2:11-15</ref> </char>
    </note> «Muse hab nato b́ s'eentsok'on bí eshuwotsi Israe'el nana'úwotsi s'iilo b́ tuwi. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Bí eshuwotsitse ikonuwere Gbs' dats ash ikon t'uk'eyat was'o b́kashefere bek't bísh b́ gatsi, t'uk'eetsmanshowere weero weersht Gbs' dats asho togdek't b́úd'i. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Ik'o b́ weeron boon b́ fakshiyituwok'o b́ jaguwots t'iwints bodek'etuwok'owa bísh araatni b́ tesh, bomó t'iwintsratsno. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Yaats guurok'onowere Israe'el ash gitetsuwots bo atsatseyo bo fayefere daatsdek't bonbaziyo geeyat ‹It ashuwtso! itwo eshu itnere, eegishe itfayeyiri?› bíet. <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>B́ tooho togiru ashman Museyi okaan gifnit ‹Neenmó noon alituwonat noatse angshituwo kone nee wosh? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Oots Gbs' dats asho núd'tsok'o taanowere úd'osh geefiya?› bíet. <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">Kesh. 18:3-4</ref> </char></note> Muse man b́shishtsok'on Gbs'itse kesht Midiyam datsomants amt gooshtsi wotat b́beeyi, Manoke nungush nana'a gituwotsi b́shuwi.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>«Muse datsmanatse hab nato b́beshiyakon Debre Sin woruwotse aat'iru t'ugi atatsi tawi laluwotse melaki iko b́be'eyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Muse man b́bek'tsok'on bíadi, karndek't b́s'iilorowere hank'o etiru Doonzo k'aro b́shishi, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‹Taahe nnihotsko Izar Izewer taane, Abarhamko Izar Izewer, Yisahak'ko Izar Izewer, Yak'obko Izar Izewer taane,› Muse were shatoon k'ewub́wutsi, s'iloshowere aawo shu'atse. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Doonzonuwere hank'o b́ eti, ‹N ned'iruwok man S'ayin datso b́ wottsotse n tufitsi c'aamo kishuwe, <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kesh. 2:14</ref> </char></note> Gbs'itse fa'a ti ashuwots weralo gond bo bek'iruwok'o bek're, kic'at bo kuhirwono shishre, mansh boon kashiyosh oot're, andoor wowe! taa neen Gbs'its woshona.›<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>«Israe'el ashuwotsu Musesh ‹Neen noats altsonat angshituwon woshtso kone?› Eton bín k'efatni botesh, wotowa boko t'ugi atatse bísh be'ets melakiyo jangon alituwonat nas' kishituwon woshdek't bomandan bín b́ woshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 7:5">Kesh. 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Taaw. 14:33</ref> </char></note> Gbs'nat Aats k'ar birokere aditsonat milikito finat bí ashuwotsi kish dek't hab natosh dats woruwtse jishtso Museyiye b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>‹Doonzo Izar Izewer taan b́ tiztsok'o mank'o it eshuwotsitse nebiyiyo itsh tuuzitwe› ett Isra'el ashuwots keewutso Museyiye b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Kesh. 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Iwi. 5:1-33</ref> </char></note> Woruwotse kakuwedek't teshts ashuwotsntonat Sin guri abaatse keewuts Ik'i melakiyonton animank'o no nihotsnton teshtso bíne. Ik'o keewuts kash imetu aap'o noosh beshitsonuwere un bíne Museyiye.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>«No nihots bína bok'efibako bísh aleratsnee, Bonibotsnowere Gbs' maants aano bo gawi. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Kesh. 32:1</ref> </char></note> Aronshowere ‹Noon Gbs'itse kishts Muse han eeg bíyats bodtsok'o no danawotse noshin shinatse sha'arr noon jishituwo Izar izewerotsi noosh doozwe› bo eti. <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Kesh. 32:2-6</ref> </char></note> Manór manz aron dozets Ik'o doozdek't bísh wosho bo t'intsi, bokishi finonowere bogenee'úwi. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Ik'onmó boatse k'aleniye b́wutsi. Daritsi k'eenwotssh bo ik'ituwok'o boon beshidek't bími. Manwere Nebiywotsn hank'o ett guut'etsok'one,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‹It Israe'el ashuwotso!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">Shúkeets gizonat woshon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">Hab nati s'eenosh woruwotse it t'ints tasheya?<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:42-43 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo. 5:25-27</ref> </char>
    </note> Dek'at it amtso Molok gofonat</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Refani eteef k'enon it arits it ik'oniye b́ teshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Bowere it kishon findek'at,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">It boosh it boosh sagadat it teshts ik'irwotsiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Taawere Babloniye ok it gishetuwok'o woshituwe.›<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:9">Kesh. 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 40">40</ref> </char>
    </note> «No nihots woruwotse gawi gofu detsfne b́ teshi, gofmanuwere Ik'o b́ keewutsok'onat b́ kitstsok'o bin fintso Museyiye b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Ik'o boshinatse b́ gishts Ik' ash Woteraw ashuwots datso bo nator no nihots bodek'ts gofani Iyasunton manok bo kindshi, Dawit dúro b́ borfetsosh manoke b beyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Sam. 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Zen. 17:1-14</ref> </char></note> Dawituwere Ik' shinatse baatso daatst Yak'ob Ik'o Izar Izewersh k'ewok wotit moo agosh Ik'o b́ k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Naash. 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Zen. 3:1-17</ref> </char></note> Ernmó Ik'í maa agtso Solomoniye.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>«B́woteferor jam falts Ik'onmó ash kishon ageets moots beerake, manwere Nebiyon hank'o ett guut'etsoniye,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49-50 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isa. 66:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> ‹Daro t be jooroniye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Datsonuwere t tufi ned'oke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Eshe ááwu naari mee taash it agetuwoni?›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">‹Bíyok t kashituwokonu awuk'one?› Etfe Doonzoni.<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>‹Jaman taa t kishon t finkoshna?› Bíeti Ik'oni.<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>«It wed'etswotso it nibo is'etswotso! it k'el kúp'uwotso! it nihuwotskok'o jam aawo S'ayin shayiro it k'efiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Nebíyiwotsitse it nihots bo gisherawo kone fa'oni? boowere kááw finetsman b́ weetuwok'o shin keewutswotsi boúd'i, It were and kááwu finetsan beshidek' imaat it úd'i. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>It Ik'i melakiwots weeron Muse nemo dek'at it teshi, ernmó kotde'atste.»<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ist'ifanos shútson jot'eyat b́k'irtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Mooshiru jirwots han boshishtsok'on nibo k'únbowutsi, Ist'ifanosi fayat bí'ats gasho bo shas'i. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Ist'ifanosmó S'ayin shayiron s'eent daro maantsan kawudek't s'iilt, Ik'i mango darotse b́bek'i, Iyesus noowere Ik' k'ani aaromadan b́ need'efere b́ bek'i, <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Eshe «Hambe, daro k'eshe b́ gwutsere ash na'o Ik'i k'ani aaro maantsan b́ need'efere t bek'iri» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Manoor bo k'aari eenon bo kuhi, bo waazono is'dekt ik wotdek't b́ maantsan bowos'i. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Kitotsno kishdek't shútson bo jot'i, gawuwotsuwre bo shemo dek'amt Sa'oli eteets jawets iko b́ kotetwok'o b́ tufi shirots ged bok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Shútson bín bo jot'fere, Ist'ifanos, «Doonzo Iyesuso! t kashu k'aaú de'e!» ett b́ k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Tuk'umaldek't, «Doonzono! bo morran boats taawk'aye!» ett k'aari eenon kuhat man ettnuwere k'ir b́wutsi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Sawol kirstiyanuwotsi b́gishtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Sawoluwe Ist'ifanosi úd'ewor bontoen ik wotatni b́ teshi, Ist'ifanos b́ k'irts aawots Iyerusalemn fa'a Ik' k'oni moowu ats gisheyewo tuu b́wutsi, woshetswotsiyere okoon amants jamwots Yhudnat Semariy awurajo maantsan bad' bowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Ik ik shayirets ashuwots Ist'fanosi boduki, káári eenono kuhat bísh bo eepi.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Wosh. 22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Sawolmó Ik'i moo t'afiyosh kaarefetstni b́teshi, mootsere moots kindt nungushuwotsnat mááts amantsuwotsn geetsdek' waat tipi moots b́ kindishiri.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doo shishiyo semariyitse nabetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Bad'wutsts amantsuwotsuwere bo amts jamoke Ik'i aap'o bodanifo. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filp'osuwere Semariy kito maantsan amt ashuwotssh Mesihiyo jango b́ dani. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Ashuwotswere Filip'os keewuts keewo bo shishor b́ finiru adits keewuwotsi bo bek'tsok'on ik nibon t'iwintsdek'tni bo k'ebiri. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Kim Shayirotsuwere k'áári eenon kuhat ay ashuwotsitse bo keshfo, durwotsnat shoklirwotsn kasha bo kashefo. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Mansh kit manitse een gene'o b́ woti.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Kit manitse Sm'oni eteets ash iko fa'e b́ teshi, ashman kitotse b́ danon finat Semari ashuwotsi aditniye b́ teshi, «Taa een ash taane!» ettni b́ keewfo. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Ash jamo múk'onu eenonu «Ashaan ashi eene ett b́ s'egeyir Ik'i angone!» ett t'iwintsdk't bo k'ebfoni. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>T'iwintsdek't bo k'ebiruwere ay aawosh danon ashuwotsi adit b́ teshtsotsne. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Ernmó Flip'os Ik'i mengisti jagonat Iyesus Krstos shútson b́ keewuts doo shishi keewo bo shishor nungushwotswere máátsuwotsuwere amanat bo gupeyi. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Smonuworu b́ oreraniyere amanat b́ gupere Filp'osntonu ik wotb́wtsi, b́ finiru adits keewwotsnat milikituwotsn bek't bíadfera b́ teshi.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Iyerusalemitse fa'a wosheetsots Semari ashuwots Ik'i aap'o bodek'tsok'o boshishtsok'on P'et'rosnat Yohanisn Semari datso maantsan bo woshi. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Semari ashuwots S'ayin shayiro bo daatsituwok'o P'et'rosnat Yohanisn amt boosh Ik'o bok'oni. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Semari ashuwots Doonzo Iyesus shútson bo gupeyi bako S'ayin shayiro konatsoru od'atse b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Mansh P'et'rosnat Yohansn bo kisho boats bo gedor ashuwots S'ayin shayiro bo dek'i.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Wosheetswotsu boats kisho bogedor S'ayin shayiro ashuwotssh b́ imestsok'o Simon b́ bek'tsok'on gizo dek'wat, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>«Taa t kisho boats tgere ashuwots S'ayin shayiro bodek'etuwok'o alan taash imere» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>P'et'rosmó hank'o bíeti, «Ik'i imo gizon daatsosh n gawutsotse n gizo neenton t'afuwe! <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>N nibo Ik'i shinatse kááwu woto b́ k'aztsotse nee keewanitse kayo wee bano deshatsne. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Eshe n gond finansh shiyanar naandre eree, daneraka n nibitsi gond finan orowa eteetwe wotiyal aab Ik'o k'onuwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Neehe s'aam okooron ns'eentsok'onat morron tipek n wotok'o taa bek'iruwe.»<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Sm'onuwere «It keewutsanitsere ik jago ti ats b́ borawok'o it it tookon taash Ik'o k'onuwere» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>P'et'rosnat Yohanisn bo gawiyakonat Doonzo aap'onwere bo keewiyakon Semari gal aywotsitse doo shishiyo nabfere Iyerusalem maantsan bo'ani.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Flip'osnat Itiyopiyi ash ikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Doonzo melakiyo Filip'ossh, «Tuur Iyerusalemiyere Gááz maants damiru weeron Muur maantsan amee» bí eti, weer manuwere woruwi weere b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Bíwere tuut bíami, manno, Itiyop'iyi dats naash iko Ik'o k'onosh Iyerusalem maants amt b́ tesh, ashaan Hndeki eteets Itiyop'iyi Nugúsúsh b dets jamatse bish fintsonat b gizatse altsoniye b́teshi, <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Bí b́ datsomants bíaanefere seregelats<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Seregela: </char><char style="ft">Eto gáári arts farshon geetsf kes'oor bí ats kede ameefoni. </char></note> bedek't nebiyiyo Isayas mas'afoni b́ nababefe b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Manóóri sa'aton S'ayin shayiro Filip'osi «Seregel manok t'iinr bínton gonkeewe» bíet. <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Mansh Filip'os bíyok wos'fere amt Itop'iyi dats ashman nebiyiyo Isayas mas'fo b́ nababefere shisht «N nababiruwo b́ biitso neesh galiruwa?» bí et. <verse eid="ACT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Itiyop'iyi dats ashonwere «Taash biishde'er keewituwo aalo taash aawuk'oneya gaalo b́ faliti?» bíet. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Bí b́ nababiru mas'aafi beyokonuwere hani b́ tesh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">«Bí shukosh jokeyiru mererok'oyiye b́ teshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Mererna'o b́s'iro k'ut'ewor s'ik bí etfok'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Bíwere keewosh b́nono aawu'atse.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:23-33 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isa. 53:7-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Bíhe keteree, kááwu angshonowere bísh imeratse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">B́ kashu datsatse k'aaúbazetsotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">B́ s'ooti jango kone fal keewiti?»<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Naashmanuwere Filip'ossh, «Nebiyiyo han b́keewu kon jangoshe? B́ took jangoshemo wee k'oshi jange? Oona neesha aab taash keewwe» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filip'oswere S'ayin mas'afanatse tuut Iyesus jangosh dooshishiyo b́ nabi. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Boamferowere aats beyok bobodi, naashmanuwere «Hamb, hanoke aatso fa'ee, tguperawok'o taan bazitu keewo eebi?» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filip'oswere «N nibi s'eenon ni'amaniyal gupewo falfne» bí eti. Naashmanwere «Iyesus Krstos Ik'o naayi b́ wottsok'o amaniruwe» b́ eti.<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Naashmanuwere seregelo b́ ned'iyetuwok'o bíazazi, Bogitetswere aatso maantsan oot't amt bo eree Filip'os Naasho b́ gupi. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Aatsotse bokeshiyakon Doonzoko S'ayin shayiro Filip'osi k'aaúbdek'i, janderbonuwere aani gitlo be'atse, b́woteferor geneúwefets b́weero sha'o dek't b́tuwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filip'osmó Azat'ositsne b́ daatseyi, K'isariyi maantsowere b́ wafetsosh kit kitotse sha'at dooshishiyo b́ nabfoni b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sa'ol Krstosi bí amantsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Wosh. 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Manoor Sawuol doonzo danifuwotsi úd'osh naakefere kahaniyots naashok bíami. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Doonzo weerindion shairu ashuwotsi nungushwotsno máátsuwotsno b́ daatsor tifde Iyerusalem maants de'er woo bín faliyit debdabeyo guud'de Demask'oyitsi ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni moowwots sh bísh imetwok'o kahini naash naasho bí aati.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Amfetst Demask'o maants b́ t'intsok'on b́ gúúratse gawerawon darotse shááno gol b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Manoor datsats dihb́wutsi, «Sa'olo! Sa'olo! eegishe taan ngishiri?» etiru k'aaro b́shishi.<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Sa'oluwere «Doonzono! kone nee?» bí eti, bíwere «Taahe nee ngishiruwo Iyesus taane, bín kosheef birro n k'efiyale neeshe iki b́gonditi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="ft">Ik ik Latini bitsetswots shiki shashats nned'iyal neesh b́gonditi etfne. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Eshe, and tuur kitots kiduwee, bíyoke k'alo neesh geyituwonowere manoke neesh keewetuwe» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Sa'olnton amfetst teshts ashuwots k'aaro shishfetst konnor bobe'awotse bo keewituwo t'ut't s'ik ett need'bowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sa'oluwere b́ dihtsoke b́ tuwi, bí aawwotsi b́ k'eshormó bek'o falratse, mansh ashaashwots b́ kisho dets dek't jishfere Demask'o maants dek't boam. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Keez aawu s'eenosh eegor bek'o b́ falrawo, b́ marawo, b́ úyawo b́tesh.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Manoor Demask'on Hananiyi eteefo Iyesus danif iko fa'e b́tesh, doonzo bek'on «Hananiyo!» ett b́s'eegi bíwere «Hamb taane, doonzono!» bí et.<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Doonzonu hank'o bíeti, «Tuur kááwi eteyiru werindu maants amee, manokno Yhud mootse Sa'oli eteetso T'erses asho gewowe, bíwere and Ik' k'onoke b́ fa'oni.» <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Sa'oluwere bí ááwuwots aani bek'o bofalituwok'o Hanani eteets asho bíyok kindt b́ kisho bíyats b́ gedfere bek'on b́ bek'i.<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Hananiyuwere hank'o ett bíaani, «Doonzono! ashaan Iyerusalemitse beyiru amantsuwotsats ay gond keewo b́fintsok'o ayuwotsoke shishre. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Manoknowere n shúts s'eegiru jamwotsi tiposh kahni naashuwotsoke alo dek're.»<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Doonzonuwere Hananiysh hank'owa bíet, «Bí t shútso Ik' danawu ashuwots shinatse, naashuwots shinatsnat Isra'el ashuwotssh danituwoniye, bí t k'ac'i sheengo b́ wottsotse bíyok amee, <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>T jangosh awuk'o gondbek'o b́dek'etuwok'owo kitsituwe bísha.»<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Mann Ananiyi maa man maants amt b́ beyiru mootsowere b́ kindi, b́ kishonowere Sa'olaats geddek't, «Ti eshu Sa'olo! hanmand n wafere weratse ni ats be'etso Doonzo Iyesus aani bek'o n falituwok'onat S'ayin shayiron n s'enetuwok'o niyok taan woshere» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Manorowere k'ok'r arts keewo bí ááwatse fed'at bí eree bek'o b́fali, tuutnwere b́gupeyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Meetwo b́ meeyihakon kup'b́wutsi, Demask'on teshts Iyesus danifuwotsnton muk' aawwotssh manoke b́ teshi.<verse eid="ACT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sa'ol Demask'on b́danitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Manorowere Sa'ol Demask'on «Iyesus Ik'o naayiye» etfere ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse daniyo b́ tuwi.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Shishts jamwotswere, «Ashaan Iyerusalemitse shútsan s'eegiru jamwotsi t'afifoniyosha? Hanok b́wowuwere boon tifde'er kahni naashuwotsok de'er amooshoshna?» ett bo'adi.<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Sa'olmó iki kup'efere bí ami, Iyesus mesihiyo b́wottsok'o keewut Demask'oyitse beyat teshts Ayhudiwots noono bo keewituwo b́t'ut'ifoni b́ tesh.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2 K'or. 11:32-33</ref> </char>
    </note> Ay aawoniyere il ayhudiwots Sa'oli úd'osh boshiyeyi, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Bímo gondon bíats bo shiyetsman danb́k'iri, boowere bín úd'osh t'uwe aawo b́ keshf fengshuwotsi bo kotfoni. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Ernmó t'úwon b́ danifuwots Sa'oli oshots geddek't gimbiyi múlotse maskotiyon oorsh bo k'ri.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sa'ol Iyerusalemn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Sa'ol Iyerusalem maants bíamor manoke fa'a Iyesus danifuwotsnton eeho b́geyi, bomó bí Krstosi bí amantsok'o arik boosh arewo b́ k'aztsotse bojamets bín boshati. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Bernabasmó Sa'oli woshetswotsok b́ t'intsre weeratse b́befere doonzo bísh b́ be'etsok'onat bín noono b́ keewitsok'o, Iyesus Shútsonowere Demask'on ááwu shuuk'on b́ danitsok'o boosh b́ keewi. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Mansh Sa'ol bonton wotdek't Iyerusalemitse bíananefo. Doonzo shútsonowere ááwu shuk'on b́ danifoni. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Grik dats ash noonon keewuf ayhudiwotsnton keewefetstni b́ mooshfo, bomó bín úd'osh k'anwutskno botesh. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Eshuwots man dan bok'rtsok'on K'isariy maants k'az dek'boami, manoknowere Terses maants k'aybíametuwok'o bowoshi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Yhuditse, Gelilitsnat Semaritse fa'a jam Ik'i moowu jeeno datsrane, kúp'onowere kup'eraniye, Doonzono! mangiyifetsat S'ayin shayirowere kup'efetsat taawon eenranee.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros Lidnat Iyop'en</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>P'et'ros dats datsatse gúúroke b́ befere Ldiyn beyiru amantsuwotsok bíami. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Manoknowere shmt nati s'eenosh es'atse k'eets Eniyi eteef duro daats b́de'k'i. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>P'et'rosuwere «Eniyo! Iyesus Krstos neen kashituwe, tuur níees'o ec'ee!» bí eti. Bíwere manoor k'az b́tuwi. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Ldaanat Saronon beyiru jametsuwots bín bek't doonzo maants k'az boaani.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Iyop'e datsatse T'abiti eteefu amants iku fa'a b tesh, Griki noonon Doork'ayi eta, b́ biitsonwere t'it'a etee, biwere sheeng keewo k'alonat t'owwotssh úni aawu imf máátsi btesh, <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Manoor bi shodat b k'iri, mashdek'tnuwere dadirotse danbani gaad'ots bin gedbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Ldi Iyop'esh karn bteshtsotse Iyop'eyitse fa'a Iyesus danifwots P'et'ros Lditse b́ fa'ok'owo shisht «Oona muk'i nteyawo noosh kaari waa boree» et git ashuwotsi bíyok woshbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Mansh P'et'ros tuut wosheetsuwotsnton b́weyi, b́ bodtsook'onowere dambani maa gáádots dek't boami, bo kenih k'irts mááts jametso bín guurdek' need' dek't eepfetst Doork' bonton kashon b beyor bwozits faaruwotsnat tah tahuwotsi bísh bokitsiri botesh, <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>P'et'ros jametsuwotsnor úratse kishk'raat tuk'maldek't Ik'o b́ k'oni, duuno maantsowere aandek't «T'abitee! tuwwe!» bíeti, biwere bi ááwwotsi wogdek'at P't'rosi b s'iili, tuuwatnu beebdek'i. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Bíwere b́ kisho jargt bin detsdek't b́ tuuzi, bo kenihi k'irts máátsuwotsnat k'osh máántsuwotsi s'eegdek't naú kashon bo shinats b́ t'intsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Keewanuwere Iyop'e dats jamatse b́ daneyi, ay ashuwotswere Doonzon boamani. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>P'et'ros Simo'oni eteets gook' shik'iru ikonton ay aawosh Iyop'en b́ beyi.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">P'et'rosnat K'orneliyosn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>K'isari datsatse befo K'orneliyosi eteets ash iko fa'e b́ teshi, bíwere Rom datsatsi kes'fuwots shirotse «It'aliy brgediya» eteyiruwotse bali naasha b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Bíwere b́ maa ash jamonton Ik'o shattsonat Ik'a b́ Ik'ifoni b́ teshi, ayhudiyotsi tugretsuwotsno b́ tep'foni, Ik'o mantso jam aawosh b́ k'onfoni. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Ik aawu jed'i sa'atok'on melakiyo bíyok t'int «K'orneliyoso!» ett b́ s'egfere shants bek'on b́ bek'i.<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>T'iwints dek't Ik'i melakiyo maants s'iilt tek'on «Doonzono! eebi b́ naaroni?» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Melakiyonu bísh hank'o bí eti, «Ik' n k'ononat t'owwotsi n tep'iruwok'o bín neen gawetuwo Ik'i shinats t'inre, <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Ando ashuwotsi Iyop'e maantsan woshar P'et'rosi eteyiruwo Smoni s'egiwe, <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>And bíhe ats k'ari ganoke fa'a gook' shik'iruwo Smon meyitse ib wotatniye b́ beyri.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Han keewts melakiyo bíatse k'aleyat bíamtsok'oon K'ornoliyos b́ mootse fiinefnef gitetsuwotsnat bíats t'ints wotaderwotsitse Ik' shatf iko s'eegdek't <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Jam keewonowere boosh b́ keewiyakon Iyop'emaants boon b́woshi.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Yaats guurok'on bo amt kitok bot'iints shirt sa'atok'on P'et'ros b́ beef moo abaatse gaad'otse Ik'o b́ k'onfera b́keshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Manorowere P'et'ros k'ak'wutsat ik keewo moosh b́ geyi, aawu mishonu k'aniyeyirwok'o bek'on bí ats b́be'eyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>B́bek'ts bek'onuwere Daro k'esheb́wutsere awd kaaton detsdek'ets eents taho arts keewo datsats b́ oot'fera. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Man abatsnowere k'osh k'osh naari s'ootswots bogeroon geetseyiru azeetsuwotsnat darotse bidiru kafuwotsuwere tahmanitse fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Manoor «P'et'rosoo! Tuur Shuh de'er moowe!» etiru k'aaro b́shishi.<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>P'et'rosmó «Doonzono! woteratse! Taa s'ayin woterawo wee kim keewo maa danaktane» bít.<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Ando aaninuwere «Ik'o s'ayin b́woshtso, kima eto neesh geyiratse» Etiru k'aaro aaniyi b́shishi. <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Manuwere keezoto b́wotiyako tah arts keewuman manoor Daromaants k'aaúdek'eyi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>P'et'ros bek'an biitso «Eegek'úna b́wotiti?» Etfetst b́ nibots b́ kic'efere K'ornoliwos woshts ashuwots aatt Sim'on moo daatsdek't b́fengeshats boned'fere botesh, <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>S'eegtnurewe «P'et'rosi eteefo Sim'on ib wotat beyiruwo hanokneya b́fa'oni» ett bo aati.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>P'et'ros bek'i keewuman biitso gawoke b́befere S'ayin shayiro bísh hank'o bíeti, «Eshe keez ashuwots neen geefne, <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Tuur ood'e, boon woshtso taa twottsosh hake baka nieraawon bonton amee.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>P'et'roswere oot't ashuwotsok amt, «Eshe, Itgeyiru asho taane, eegoshe itweyi?» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Bowere «No noweyiye báli naasho K'ornelewosokne, bíhe Ayhudi ash ash jamwots bo mangiyiru Ik'i ash dooniye, neen b́ moots s'eegiyir n etetuwo b́ k'ebetuwok'o S'ayin melakiyo bísh kitst keewure» bo et. <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>P't'rosu moots boon kindsht bí ibiyakon k'ondek'tnuwere b́ k'eezi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Yaatsok'onowere tuut bonton bíami, Iyop'en fa'a eshuwotsitse ik ikuwots bínton boami. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Gitl aawotso K'isari bo bodi, K'orneliyosu b́ jaguwotsnat bíats t'ints b́ tohuwotsi s'eegdek't P'et'rosi b́kotiri. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>P'et'ros moots b́ kindor K'orneliyos bíyok t'int b́ tufi shirots dihit bín b́ k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>P'et'rosmó «Tuuwe! Taa neenk'o ash taane!» ett b́ tizi.<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Bínton keewefetst gitso maants b́ kindor ay ashuwots ko'edek't bo befere b́ daatsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Bosh hank'o b́ eti, «Ayhudi wotts ashosh k'osh ashonton ik wotonat b́moots kindo nemo b́ bazitsok'o itworu it tookon danfte, ernmó konuworu s'ayin woterawo wee kima ti erawok'o Ik'o taash kitsre. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Mansh taash woshewor ik k'efalo tweyi, eshe eegosh taan it s'eegtsok'owo danosh geefe.»<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>K'orneliyosu hank'o bíeti, «Awd aawoniye shin ewaar jed'i sa'aton t mootse Ik'o tk'onfera t teshi, eshe, tgawraniye ik asho goliru taho tahedek't t shinats b́ need'i, <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Hank'owere taash bí eti, ‹K'orneliyoso! Ik'o n k'ono shishre, t'owwotsi ntep'irwo gawure, <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Eshe Iyop'e maants ashuwotsi woshar P'et'rosi eteyiruwo Sim'oni s'egiwe, bíwere ats k'ari ganoke fa'a gook' shiik'fo Simon mootse ibo wotatniye b́ beyiri,› <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Mansh manoor wosheets ashuwotsi niyok twoshi, neewere n waatsotse sheenge nfini, eshe Ik'o nkeewituwok'o neesh keewuwe bietts jamo shishosh noúnets Ik'i shinatse hanok kaku weerone.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros keew keewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Iwi. 10:17</ref> </char>
    </note> P'et'ros hank'o ett keewo dek't b́tuwi, «Arikon Ik'o asho ashaatse b́ bogabogshrawok'o t'iwintsdek'ree, <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Aawoki dats asho b́wotiyalor Ik' sharr kááwu keewo b́ finitka wotiyal Ik'o bín k'ebetuwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Ik'o aap'tso Isra'elsh b́wooshtsok'o daneke, Jami doonzo Iyesus Krstosn jeeno nabfere b́ waawere boshee. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Yohans gupi jango nabo b́ tuutsortson Gelilitse tuut Yhud dats jamatse wotts keewo danfte.<verse eid="ACT 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>«Dabtnu Ik'o Nazrettso Iyesusi S'ayin shayiron b́ futtsok'onat angono b́ imtsok'o danfte, Ik'onuwere bínton b́ fa'otse bíwere sheeng keewo finefere Dabilosn detsets jamwots kashifere b́ gúúri.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>«Yhud gat'eriyotsnat Iyerusalem kitotse b́ k'alts keewu jamosh no gawu noone, bomó bín mitats jitdek't boúd'i. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Ernmó Ik'o keezl aawots k'irotse tizt b́ be'etuwok'o b́ woshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>B́ be'ewwere shin shnon Ik'on marat'ets gawwotssha bako ash jamoshaliye, bíwere k'irotse b́ tuwiyakon no bonton iknon maat úshats gawwots no nee, <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Keewuhan ashuwotssh no shishituwok'o bíwere kashetswotsnat k'irtsuwotsats bíangshituwok'o Ik'oke naashiyetso b́ wottsok'o no gawituwok'o noon azazere. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Bín amanitu jamo b́ shútson morrosh oorowe eto b́ daatsituwok'o nebiyi jamwots bísh gawitune.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i ash woterawwots amanar S'ayin shayiro bodek'etuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>P'et'ros man b́ keewor b́ keewiruman shishts ash jametsuwotsats S'ayin shayiro b́ oot'i. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>P'et'rosnton waatsuwots gof amts ayhudiwotsitsi Krstiyaniwotsitse Ik'o Ik'i ash Woteraw ashuwotssh S'ayin shayiro b́ imtsok'o bo bek'tsok'on bo adi. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Ik'i ash Woteraw ashuwotssh S'ayin shayiro imetsok'o dantsuwotswere handr noon keewon keewufetst Ik'o údon bomangifere bo shishtsotsna. Manoor P'et'ros <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Ashaanots nokok'o S'ayin shayiro dek'reene, béré, bo aatson boguperawok'o kone baziti?» ett b́ keewi. <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Mansh Iyesus Krstos shútson bogupetuwok'o bíazazi, Maniyere il P'et'ros bonton muk' aawwotssh b́teshetuwok'o bok'oni.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros eegosh Ik' ash woterawwotsok bíamtsi jango b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Yhud datsatse fa'a woshetswotsnat eshuwwotsn Ik' ash woterawwots Ik' aap'o bo dek'tsok'o bo shishi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>P'et'rosu Iyerusalem maantsan aanat b́keshor gof amo geyk b́ wotok'o amaniru ayhudiyots, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>«Egish gof amaawu ashuwots meyts kindat bonton nmeyi?» ett bín bok'oori. <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Ernmó P'et'ros wotts jamo hank'o ett ik ikon keewo dek't b́tuwi.<verse eid="ACT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Taa Iyop'e kitotse Ik' k'onatse tbeefere bek'o tbek'i, t bek'tsonúwere een magaraji arts keewo awd kaaton detsdek'ere darotse oot't tiyok b́ weyri, <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Bínowere t'iwints t s'iile magaraji tahotse Gizuwotsnat dini s'otswotsn, datsatse getseyiruwotsnat daaratse bidiru kafuwotsi t bek'i, <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>‹P'et'roso! tuur shuhuder moowe!› etiru k'aaro tshishi, <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Taamó ‹Woteratse Doonzono!! s'ayin woterawo wee kim wotts keewo b́jamon tnonots ger danaak taane› tieti. <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Ernmó gitlo, ‹Ik'o s'ayin b́ woshtso nee kima eto neesh geyiratse› etiru k'aro darotse taash bíanere t shishi. <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Hanwere keezoto b́ wotiyakon tah arts keewuman jamon daro maantsan t'op'e b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Manoor K'isariyon tiyok wosheets keez ashuwots taa t beyiru moowok waat bobodi. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Hake baka t eraniyere bonton t ametuwok'o S'ayin shayiro taash b́ keewi, eshu shirtanotsu taantoniye bo faoni b́ teshi, bonton iknon amatnuwere K'orneliyosi eteyiru asho moots no kindi. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Bíwere melakiyo b́ mootse b́ned'efere b́ bek'tsok'on ‹Iyop'e maantsan asho woshar P'et'rosi eteyiruwo Sm'oni s'eegiywe, <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Bíwere neenat nmaa ash jamo b́ kashit aap'o itsh keewituwe› bíettsok'o noosh b́ keewi. <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Taawere keewo dek'at t tuure S'ayin shayiro shini noats b́ ot'tsok'o boatso b́ oot'i. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Wosh. 1:5</ref> </char></note> Manoor ‹Yohanis aatson b́ gupi, itmó S'ayn Shayiron gupetute› ett Doonzo keewts aap'o gawtdek'i. <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>No doonz Iyesus Krstosn no amanor Ik'o noosh b́ imts imo bosho b́ imtsotse, eshe Ik'o baziyosh falituwo taa kone!»<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Bowere han boshishtsok'on bo keewituwo t'ut't s'k et bowutsi, «Eshe Ik'o, Ik' ashwoteraw ashuwots kashi handrosh boon betsitu naandre eti nibo boosh imre,» ett Ik'o bo udi.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amantsuwotssh Ans'okiyon «Kirstaniyotsi» eteetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Wosh. 8:1-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Ist'ifanosi k'is'dek't úd'etson tuwts gisheyi jagon bad'ts amantsuwots Fink'en tuut K'op'rosn Ans'okiyo b́ borfetso bo ami, bí aap'ono ayhudiyotssha bako k'oshuwotssh keewakno bo teshi. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Wotowa bako K'op'rosnat K'erenon waats amants ik ikuwots Ans'okiyo bo amor Girikiyotssh dab́ doonzo Iyesus doo shishiyo bo keewi. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Doonzonuwere boon bíangon b́ tep'fera b́ teshi, ay ashuwotsu amanat doonzo maantsan boaani.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Iyerusalemitse fa'a Ik' moow keewan b shishtsotse Barnabasi Ans'okiyo maantsan b woshi. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Bíwere amt Ik'o b́ s'aato ashuwotssh awuk'on b́ imtsok'o b́ bek'tsotse geneú b́wutsi, jamwotsu bo nib s'eenon kup'ar doonzo amanetsuwotsi wotar bo beetuewk'o bíizi. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Bíwere S'ayn shayironat imnetiyon s'eenk ash sheeng b́ teshtsotse bo taawo ay wotts ashuwots doonzo maantsan boaani.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Maniye okoon Barnabas Sa'oli geyosh T'erses maantsan bíami. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Datsdek'tnuwe Ans'okiyo maantsan dek't b́weyi, gitetswotsuwere ik nati s'eenosh amants ashuwotsnton ik wotat ay ashuwotsi bo daniyi, amantsuwotsuwere tewurerosh Ans'okiyon, «Kirstiyaniwotsi» ett s'egeyi.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Manoor ik ik Nebiyinee ett s'eegeyiru danifuwots Iyerusalemn Ans'okiyo maantsan bo ami, <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Wosh. 21:10</ref> </char></note> Boyitsnowere iko Agabosi eteetso tuut dats jamatse k'ak' eeno b́ wotituwok'o S'ayin shayiro b́tizre bek'on bek't b́ keewi, hanuwere b́ woti Rom naashuwots naasho K'elawudiyos dúrone b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Mansh Ans'okiyon beyiru amantsuwots Yihudon beyiru eshuwotssh bo took tookon bo faltsok'o c'oc'de'er boon tep'o damiyetuwok'o boeti. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Gizmano kishdek't Barnabasnat Sa'ol kishon Ik' máá eenashwotssh bowoshi.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Krstiyaniwotsats bodts een gishewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Man dúr nuguso Herodis Ik'i maa ash ik ikuwotsi gisho dek' b́tuwi, <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Yohans eshuwi Yak'obi shikon b́ úd'iyi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Keewu manuwere ayhudiwotsi b́ geneeúshtsok'o b́bek'tsok'on P'et'rosi ando aani detsi b́k'ri, man b́wotuwere ayhudiwots tush meyi baaliyo bomangif aawwotsitsna b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-2">Kesh. 12:1-2</ref> </char></note> P'et'rosi b́detsiyehakon tipi moots kindshb́k'ri, ayhudiwots Fazigi baaliyoniye hakon ash ashuwotsok b́ t'intsfetso kes' kes'fwots awd awdon bokotetuwok'o awd jirwotssh imb́k'ri. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Mann P'et'ros tipi mootse detseyatni b́ kotefoni, ernmó Ik'i moowu b́ jangosh Ik'o maants kup'idek'atni b k'onfoni.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i melakiyo tipi mootse P'et'rosi b́bitstsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Yaats guurok'on Herodis P't'rosi ash ashosh t'intso gawudek'tni b́tesh, t'úmanots P'et'ros Habliyion tipeyat kes' kes'f giti dagotsa b́k'eyiri b́tesh, k'osh wotaderwotsuwere wee maa fengeshoni bokotiri. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Manoor doonzo melkiyo bíats be'eyat, tipi moots c'eesho shaano gol b́wutsi, melakiwonwere P'etros lalk'o t'awit tuzt «Káári tuuwe!» bíeti, habiliyonu b́ kishotsere fed'b́gutsi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Melakiyonu «Ntaho tahade'er! nc'amono gerde'e!» bí eti. P'et'rosuwere azazetsok'o b́ k'ali, melakiyonu «N nat'alo tahader tshuutso wowe!» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>P'et'ros waat b́ shuutso b́tuwi, bek'a b́ bek'iri bísh bíari bako melakiyo b́ k'alts jamo ar areratse. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Iknonat gitl koteyiruwokere beshat kitootsan damiru biri is'ok bobodi. Is'onuwere asho b́ t'awirawo hank'on bíaal k'esheb́gutsere kesht ik weridon beshat k'az boami, b́ gawurawo melakiyo P't'rosatse k'aleyat bíami.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>P'et'rosu b́ atso dant, «Doonzo b́ melakiyo woshat Herodis kishotsnat Ayhudi ashuwots bo kotiru keewu jamotse taan b́ kashitsok'o and taa arikon danre!» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Man dan b́k'rihakon ay ashuwots ikok kakuwedek't Ik'o bok'oniruwok Mariyam mook bíam, Mariyam manuwere Mark'osi eteetso Yohans indi btesh. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>P'et'ros manok bodt úriweertso fengesho b́k'oftsok'oon Rodayi eteets gon iku koni b́wottsok'o danosh fengeshomants bweyi. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>P'et'ros k'aar b́wottsok'o danbk'rtsok'on b gene'úwi aytsatse tuwtson fengesho b k'eshrawon wos'aat gitsomaand kindat «P'et'ros fengeshatse b́need'iri!» etaat b keewi. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Bowere «Geeniya nwutsi!» bo eti. Bimó «Arikon bíne!» arikon bín bek're etaat bkeewi, boowere bere «Bín kotiru melakiye b́wotiti» boeti.<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>P'et'rosmó maa fengsho k'ofo ned'iratse, boowere fengesho k'eshdek't bos'iloor bo'adi. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Bímó s'k boetetuwok'o b́kishon kitst doonzo awuk'o k'aldek't tipi mootse bín b́kishtsok'o boosh keewut «Keewan Yak'obnat oorts amantsuwotssho keewwere» bíet. Boatse k'aleyat k'osh beyok k'az bími.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>B́gatstsok'onowere kes' kes'fwots «P'et'rosats eege b́woti k'úna?» ett ayidek't kic'bowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herodisuwere b́weeron P'et'rosi geyit b́t'ut'tsok'on fengesh kotiruwotsi b́ maramariyakon boon úd'etuwok'o bíazazi, maniyere hakon Herodis Yhud datsatse tuut K'isariyi maants amt manoke beeb́wutsi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herodis k'ir k'iro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Herodis T'irosnat Sidon dats ashuwotsats ayidek't fayatni b́tesh, boowere ikwotdek't waat, Nugúsok karnts guutso Blast'osi bonton b́tep'ish k'ondek't eeki bodek'iyakon Nugúso manosh bo aati, man bok'aluwere bodatsuu misho bdaatsfo Nugúso datsatse b́ teshtsosha.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Detsets aawmanots Herodis b́ naashi taho kardek't naashi jorats be'dek't ash ashosh keewo b́keewi. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Ash ashonwere «Hanuwo Izar Izewer k'aara bako ash k'aaraliye!» ett bokuhi. <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Herodis Ik'osh mango b́ imaawo b́ oortsotse manoor doonzo melakiyo togb́k'rere shipro gedt b́k'iri.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Ik' aap'onmo aawu aawon eenfetst gawunfera bíamfo. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Bernabasnat Sa'oln boamts fino isht Iyerusalemitsere Ans'oki datsomand k'azboaan, Mark'osi eteetso Yohansnowere bonton dek't boweyi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Bernabasnat Sa'oln S'ayin shayiron galeyat daniyosh bowoshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Ans'okitse fa'a Ik'i moowutse nebiyiwotsinat danifuwots fa'ano botesh, boowere, Bernabasi, aak'a eteetso Sm'onu, K'eren datsats asho Lukyosu, awdlo kayo keewutso Herodisnton towaat eentso Mnahenat Sa'olne fa'ane boteshi. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Bo doonzosh finefetst s'oomoke bobefere S'ayin shayiro «Taa boon t galts finosh Bernabasnat Sawln taash galuwere» bíet.<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Bowere s'oomat Ik'o bo k'oniyakon bokishono boats gedt wosh bok'iri.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabasnat Sawln K'op'rositse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Barnabasnat Sawln S'ayin shayiron wosheyat Selewik'iyo maats boami. Manokno markabon K'op'ros maats boami. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Selamis kitots bo bodtsok'on ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse Ik'i aap'o bodani, Yohanis Mark'oswere bonton wotat boosh bodabiri b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Aatso gúrts K'op'ros datsu k'ut't p'afuyi bo bodtsok'on Baryesusi eteefo ayhudits ik'ets ash iko daats bodek'i, bímó kootets nebiyiya b́ tesh. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>B́befonuwere Sergyos P'awlosi eteets t'iwintsdek'ts dats k'eezfontoni b́tesh, dats k'eezfan Bernabasnat Sa'oln s'eegt Ik' aap'o k'ebo b́ geyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Ernmó Griki noon keew keewon «Elimas» ett s'eegets ik'etso Beryesus dats k'eezfo bíamanerawok'o geeyat Bernabasnat Sa'oln b́ k'efi. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>P'awlosi eteetso Sa'olmó S'ayin shayiron s'eent ashman t'iwintsdek't s'iilt hank'owa bísh bíet, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>«Nee Dabilos naayo! ar jami t'alatono! dirshonat gond jamon s'eentsono, kááwu wottso doonzo weerindo k'uuriyo k'azalk neeneya! <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Andoor hambe! doonzo kisho neen togetuwee, doogonowere wotitune, muk' gizewosh aawu shaano be'atsnee.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Manoor bíaawwotsi bampulonat t'aluwo ipb́k'iri, b́ kisho deshde'er jishit asho b́ ganoke geyo dek'b́tuwi. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Dats k'ezfonuwere wotts jamo b́ bek'tsok'on bíamani, doonzo jangosho b́shishts danon bíadi.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabasnat P'awlosn P'isdi Datso Maantse Fa'a Ans'okiyomats Bíamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Maniyere okoon P'awlosnt b́ tohuwotsn Markabats keshdek't P'afutse P'nflyo maantse daatseyiru P'erge maants boami, Mark'osi eteyiruwo Yohanismó boatse k'aleyat Iyerusalem maants aanat bíami. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Boomó P'ergeyiyere tuut P'isdyayitsi datsatse fa'a Ans'okiyo maats boami, sanbati aawon ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni moots kindt beebowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Muse nemonat Nebiyiwots mas'afwots nababeyakon Ayhudi Ik' k'oni maa naashuwots «T eshuwotso, ashuwotsi kup'it izo detsfte wotiyal keewwere» ett P'awlosots maants asho bo woshi. <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Mansh P'awlos tuut ashosh kishon b́koli, hank'o ett b́keewi, «Isra'el ashuwotsnat Ik' shatiru Ik' ash woterawwotso! k'ewere! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kesh. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">12:51</ref> </char></note> Israe'el ashaanotsko Izar Izewer yoots no nihotsi galre, Gbs'datsatse boteshor een ashuwotsi boon b́woshi, bí een angonowere datsmanatse boon b́kishi. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Hab́natonoshowere woruwotse boon b́ k'ami, <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Iwi. 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Iya. 14:1</ref></char></note> Kan'an datsatse shawat nugúsuwotsi t'afit bodatso bíashwotssh b́naatiyi, <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Mes. 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam. 3:20</ref> </char></note> Jaman awd bale balk'ats naato b́ ishi, maniyakowere nebiyo Samu'el dúrosh b́ borfetso Mesafntiyotsi b́ imi.<verse eid="ACT 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10:21</ref> </char>
    </note> «Manats dabt nugúso boosh b́ naashituwok'o Ik'o bok'oni, Ik'onuwere Biniyam jir wottso K'is naayi Sa'oli hab natosh boosh b́ naashiyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Sam. 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Dub. 89:20</ref> </char></note> Sa'olno naashatse b́ orshiyakon Dawiti b́ naashiyi, Ik'onu Dawit jangosh b́ gawor, ‹T shuntsok'o wottso, tshunono fintso, Isey naayi Dwiti daatsre› etre. <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Ashaan naarotse Ik'o b́ jangits keewok'on Isra'eli kashituwo Iyesusi boosh b́ tuuzi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk'. 3:3</ref> </char></note> Iyesus b́ waraftse shinon Yohanis Israe'el ash jamosh naandrone err gupeyo nabre b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk'. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:20-27">Yoh. 1:20-27</ref> </char></note> Yohanis b́ fino b́ ishtsok'on ‹Taa kone itsh tiari? Taahe Mesihiyo taanaliye, ernmó b́ c'aami tiponoru dab bitsosh tborawo t shutsatse k'osho weetuwe› bí etfoni.<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>«It Abraham naaratse shuwets eshuwwotsnat itwere Ik' shatiru Ik' ash woterawwotso! bín kashet wóóshan woshe noshee <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Iyerusalemn beyiru ashuwotsnat boon jishiruwots Iyesus kashitso b́ wottsok'o danatsne, sanbati aawu aawon nababeyiru nebiyiwots mas'aafwotsi t'iwintso bok'aztsosh bíats boangshor bek'on keewetso b́s'eenetuwok'o woshrne. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Mat. 27:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:4-14">Mar. 15:4-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luk'. 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Yoh. 19:15</ref> </char></note> K'irosh bín betsit keewo eegoru bíatse datso bok'azaloru bín boosh b́ úd'ituwok'o P'ilat'osi bo k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref> </char></note> B́ jangosh guut'ets jamo b́s'eeniyakon jitatse orshdek't boduki, <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Ernmó Ik'o k'irotse bín b́tizi. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Wosh. 1:3</ref> </char></note> Geliltsere Iyerusalem maants bínton waatsuwotsshowere ay aawosh boats b́ be'eyi, boowere and ashuwots shinatse b́ gawwotsiye. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>No itsh detsdek' nowatso Ik'o nonihotssh jangit b́ ímts doo shishiyi keewoniye. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Dub. 2:7</ref> </char></note> Ik'o Iyesusi k'irotse b́tiztsotse b́jangitsano noosh bo nanaúwotssh finats jitsre, manuwere gitli Dubotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‹Nee tnay neene, taa neen hambets shuure,›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:33">ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="ACT 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa. 55:3</ref> </char></note> B́ o'awok'o Ik'o k'irotse b́ tiztsok'o daniyosh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‹S'ayin amanets deero</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">Dawitsh jangit imetso itsh imetuwe› ett keewure.<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Dub. 16:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Dabt k'osh dubotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‹N Naayi S'ayino b́ ok'etwok'o woshatsne› bí eti<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Ernmó Dawit b́ dúr jamo b́ fino Ik'i shuntso b́s'eentsyakon k'irre, nihwotsntonuwere duukere, ok'ree. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref> </char></note> Ik'o k'irotse b́tiztsonmó oa'atse. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>Eshe tí eshuwotso! Morrosh oorowe eto datsetuwo Iyesusn b́wottsok'owo itsh nabetsok'o dande'ere, <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Bín amants jamo Muse weeron imets nemo nas'o kisho b́ falawu morr jamatse nas'o keshituwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Mansh nebiyatiyotsn Ik'o hank'o ett b́ keewetso itats b́ borawok'o korde'ere, <verse eid="ACT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>‹It aatsnirwots s'iilere! adúwere! t'afuwere!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Konuworu asho itsh b́ keewure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">It amanerawu fino itdúroon finitwe.› »<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>P'awlosn at Barnabasn ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse bokeshfere keewan weet sanbatots aani boosh bokewituwok'o ashuwotsi bok'oni. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Ayhudi Ik' k'oni moots ko'etswots bad'bowutstsok'oon ay Ayhudi jirwotsnat Ayhudi imnetiyots kindt Ik' Ik'iru Ashuwots P'awlosnt Barnabasn shuutso botuwi, P'awlosnt Barnabasnowere ashuwotsi danit Ik'i s'aaton kup'ar bobetuwok'o boosh bogawiyi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Weet sanbatono kitotse beyiru ashuwotsitse aywots, Ik'i aap'o shishosh ko'ebowutsi, <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Ayhudiyots ash ashuwots ay bowottsok'o bo bek'tsosh okooron s'een bowutsi, b́ keewono k'efefetst P'awlosi boc'ashi, <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>P'awlosn at Barnabasnomó hank'o ett ááwu shuk'on bokeewi, «Ik' aap'o shini itsh keewo geyife, it de'atsone it etalomó dúre dúr kasho itsh b́ woterawok'o it tookats it angshtsotse hamb no Ik' ash woterawwots maants wongrer ametuwone. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Manowere nok'alitiye doonzo, ‹Kasho dats daarats b́borfetso n doowetuwok'o Ik' ash Woteraw ashuwotssh shááno neen woshre› ett b́ azaztsotsne.»<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Ik' ash woterawwots han boshishtsok'n geneú bowutsi doonzo aap'o bomangiyi, dúre dúr kashosh gaalets jamwotswrere boamani.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Doonzo aap'onuwere dats jamanats bad'b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Ayhudi jishiruwotsmó ayhudi imnetiyo amaniru gaalets mááts máátsuwtsenat kititsi een een ashuwotsi gondon P'awlosnat Barnabasn gishetuwok'o bowoshi, bo datsatsnowere boon bokishi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat. 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar. 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk'. 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref> </char></note> P'awlosnat Barnabasn boats botufatsi k'undo tebazt Ik'oniyon maants boami. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>B́ danifuwosuwere gene'onat S'ayn shayiron bos'eeni.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlosn at Bernabasn Ik'oniyonitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Ik'oniyonitse P'awlosnat Bernabasn towaat ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni moots bokindi, manoknowere ay ayhudiwotsnat Ik' ash Woteraw ayidek't ayts ashuwots bo amanefetsosh bodaniyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Amaneraw ayhudiwotsmó Ik'i ash woterawwotsi tuzit eshuwotsats shit'o b́weetwok'o bok'ali. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Mansh P'awlosnat Bernabasn doonzo keewo ááwu shuk'on keewfetst manoke ayi gizewos boteshi, doonzonwere milikitwotsnat adits keewwotsi bokishon bofinetwok'o alo boosh imt, b́ s'aati aap'o ariko b́wottsok'o b́kiitsfoni.<verse eid="ACT 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Kitutse beyiruwotsmó, gitoko kayaat bado ayhudiwotsnton bado woshetswotsnton bowoti.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Ik' ash woterawwotsna ayhudiwots bo naashuwotsnton wotdek't P'awlosnat Bernabasn kaarar shútson togosh bogeyi, <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>P'awlosn at Bernabasn man bodantsok'on Lst'ranat Derbeyi eteef Lik'a'on kituwotsnat bogúúratse fa'a datsats giifat boami. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Manoknowere doo shishiyo bonabi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlosnat Barnabasn List'rnat Derbeyitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Lst'ra datsatse b́ tufo lasha'awutsts ash iko fa'e b́tesh, ashaan b́ shuweetson tuut dura b́teshtsotse b́ tufoon sha'a danaka, <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Ashaan P'awlos b́ keewor bedek'tni b́ k'ebiri b́ tesh, P'awlos ashman t'iwintsdek't s'iilt kashosh bín betsit imnetiyo b́ detso b́ bek'tsok'on, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>«Kaawde'er ntufoon need'owe!» ett k'aari eenon b́keewi, ashmanwere t'oolat tuut hake bak b́sha'i. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Ashuwotswere P'awlos b́ k'altso bo bek'tsok'on, bok'aaro eenshdek't «Ik'uwots ash aron wotdek't nok oot'rnee!» ett Lik'aoni noon keewu keewon bokeewi. <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Bernabasshower «Dya» boeti. Keewu keewiruwo P'awlosi b́ teshtsotse bísh «Hermeniye» boeti. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Kitoniyere úratse fa'o diyako s'ayin máá kahniyo minzi wrwotsnat k'odets funduwotsnowere kiti fengesho maants dek'wat ash ashonton ikwotdek't P'awlosnat Bernabasnsh wosho t'intsosh b́geyi.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Wosheets, P'awlosnat Benabasn man boshishtsok'on shiyanon botaho bo gaat'i, ash asho maantsowere wos't kuhefets hank'o boeti, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>«It ash ashuwots eegishe han itk'aliri? Nowoor itnk'o ash noone, Noo hanok nowaa it hank'o k'awuntsal keewu jamatse wokar daro, datso, aatsk'aronat bogitsotse daatseyiru jamo aztso Kashetso Izar Izewer maants it aanituwok'o sheeng keewo shishiyishee, <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Beshts dúrowotsitse ash jamo botook weeron boametuwok'o Ik'o boon kazb́k'ri, <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Wotowa bako bíaawuk'o sheengo Izar Izeweri b́ wottsok'o gaawit sheeng fino k'alo need'iratse, darotse awusho itsh bútsiree, maay kakuwi shashwotsi itsh b́ imi, Mishonat geneeúon itn b́woriyi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Wosheetsots mank'o dabt bokeewiyalor ash asho boosh wosho t'intso b́k'azetuwok'o bobazi ayidek' kic'oone.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Ayhudiwotsmó Ans'okiyonat t Ik'oniyonn manok waat ash asho tuzdek't P'awlosi shútson botogetuwok'o bowoshi, k'irb́wutstsok'o bíarere geets dek't kitotse kishbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Ernmó b́danifuwots waat bín gúúrdek't boned'fere P'awlos tuut kitots b́kindi, yaats guurok'onowere Bernabasnton Derbe maants bíami.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlosnat Bernabasn Sori datsatse fa'ú Ans'okiyo maants bíantsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>P'awlosnat Bernabasn Derbe datsatse doo shishiyo danit ay ashuwotsi amantsuwotsi bowoshiyakon Lst'ronat Ik'oniyonn beshat P'sdiyin fa'úts Ans'okits boami. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Dats jam manotsatsnowere amantsuwots boamantsats kup'bodek'etuwok'o boon kup'iyonat izosh «Ik'i mengstots kindosh ay gondo noosh geyife» etfetst boon bdaniyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Ik' k'oni maa mootse eenash eenashuwotsnowere boosh bonaashi, s'omat Ik'o bok'oniyakonowere bín boamants doonzosh adaro imbok'ri.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>P'sdiyanowere beshat P'nfli maants boami, <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>P'ergeyitsnowere Ik' aap'tso bodaniyakon At'aliyi maants boami, <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Maniyere hakonowere bok'alts Ik'i s'aatosh adaro boosh ímeets Ans'okimaants markabon boami.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Manok bobodetsok'on amantsuwotsi ikok kakudek't Ik'o awuk'o k'alt bonton wotdek't b́fiints jamonat Ik'i ash woterawwotswor boamanituwok'o awuk'o k'alt fengesho boosh b́k'eshtsok'o bokeewi <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Manoknowere amantsuwotsnton ay aawo boteshi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Iyerusalemitse kakuwets kakuwewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Wosh. 10:1-43</ref> </char>
    </note> Ash ik ikuwots Yhuditsere Ans'oki maants amt «Musesh imets nemok'on gofo it amala bako kasho falratste» ett amantsuwotsi daniyo dek'botuwi. <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>P'awlosnat Bernabasn manjangosh ash ashuwotsnton wed'eyat moosho bomooshi, Maniyere okoon P'awlosnat Bernabasn Ans'okitse fa'e k'osh muk' eshuwotsnton wotde'er Iyerusalemits amr b́jango woshetswotsnat eenashuwotsnsh bot'intsituwok'o woshi.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Mansh bo Ik'i moon wosheyat boami, Fink'enat Semaritse bobesheferowere Ik'i ashwoterawwots Ik'o maants boaano bokeewi, keewetsanuwere krstiyani jametsuwotsi b́geneúshi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Iyerusalemits bobodtsok'on Ik'i moowunat woshetswotsn, eenashuwotswere boon bodek'i, wosheetsuwotswere Ik'o bonton wotdek't b́ fintso boosh bokeewi. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Ernmó Ferisawino eteefuwots jirwotsits wotts ik ik amantsuwots tuut «Ik'i ash woterawwots gofo amr Muse nemo bokotetuwok'o k'alo geyife» boeti.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Woshetswotsnat eenashuwotsn keewan shuu'ar s'ilosh kakuwebodek'i, <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Ay moosho mosheyakonowere P'et'ros tuut boosh hank'o bíeti, «Eshuwwotso, Ik'i ash woterawwots taan Doo shishiyo k'ewur boamanituwok'o taan ititse galb́dek'tsok'o danfte. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:5">Wosh. 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10:44</ref> </char></note> Ash nib dantso Izar Izewer, S'ayin shayiro noosh b́imtsok'o booshowere imtni b́ gawi. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Bonibo amanon b́ s'ayntstsosh noonat bodagotse eegoru k'osh k'osho woshratse. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Eshe, nonihotsi wotowa noo kuro nofalrawu k'ambariyo amantsuwots bimbats kuriyon and Ik'o eegishe itfadiri? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Noo nokashit bokok'o doonzo Iyesus s'aaton b́ woto amaniruwone.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Manoor kakuwets ash jamo s'ik ett Bernabasnat P'awlosn boweeron Ik'o Ik' ash woterawwots dagotse b́ fints milikitonat adits keewu jamo bokeewure adt k'ebeyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Bo keewut boishiyak, Yak'ob hank'o ett bíaniyi «Ti eshuwotso! aab taan k'ewere! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Ik'o b́ shútson s'eeget ik ikashuwotsi bo dagotse galdek'osh shinshino awuk'o k'alt Ik' ash woterawwotsi waa b́s'iiltsok'o Sim'on keewure. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Hasabiyantonuwerfe nebiywots keewuts keewo manee, hank'o ett guut'etsok'one,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>‹Haniyehak aani weetuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Gahtso Dawit moo agetuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">B́ gahts tiish tishonowere tizde'er aaniy need'ituwe.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Hanowere t k'alit oorts ashuwotsnat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">T shútson s'eegets Ik'i ash Woteraw jamwots Ik'o bogeytuwok'owee,<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo. 9:11-12</ref> </char>
    </note> Yootstson jaman danitso Ik'o taa hank'o etiruwe,›<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>«Mansh tiaasabiyo Ik'omaants aanits Ik'i ash woterawwotsi nokic'irawok'owee. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Kesh. 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Lew. 17:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">18:6-23</ref> </char></note> Maniyere ‹Woterawu ik'uwotssh t'iintsotse kiimts woshi misho máák'ayere, widatse wokoore, shukeerawonat b́ s'atso b́kud'erawo guuk'at k'irts gizi meetso máák'ayere, s'atsonowere máák'ayere› err boosh guud'one. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Yootstson b́ tuutson Muse nemó sanbati aawu jamon ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse nababefe b́teshi, Ik'i keewuts keewonowere kitt kitotse nabefee.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakuweetsmanots k'ut'tsonat amantsuwotssh guut'ets woshon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Maniyere hakon woshetswotsnat eenashuwotsn Ik'i maa ash jamonton wotdek't kakuweetsmanotsitse k'ats ashuwotsi marat'dek't P'awlosnat Bernabasnton Ans'okimaants daamiwosh k'ut'bok'ri, Mansh eshuwotsitse jiishon shútsi sheengo detstswotsi Bersabasi eteetso Yhudnat Silasn marat'bodek'i. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Guut'ets woshi work'ato bokishon bo damiy, Wosh detsts work'atmanuwere hank'o etka b́tesh, «Noo woshetswotsnat eenash eenashuwots it eshuwots, Ans'okinat Soryon, Kilk'iyitsnowere beyiruwots Ik'i ashwoterawwots jirwotsi wottsuwotssh no eshuwotssh jamo itsh t'intsiruwone. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Noyitse ik ik ashuwots noo boon noazazerawon it maants waat itsh bokeewts keewon iti bokic'itsok'onat itn bodanditsok'o shishrone. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Mansh ikok ko'enowutsiyakon woshetuwotsi marat'de'er shuneets no eshuu eshuwwots Barenabasnat P'awlosn ton itmaants woshosh no shiyeyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Barnabasnat P'awlosn doonzo Iyesus Krstos jangosh bo kasho beshidek't imknee. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>No guut'tsonowere noonon dabr itsh bo keewituwok'o Yhudnat Silasn wosherone. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Itsh not'intsts geyit keewanotsiyere okoon k'osh mang kuro itats nokurirawok'oyish noo S'ayin shayironton sheeng b́wotere daatsrone. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Woteraw ik'osh t'intsetsotse kiimts misho maak'ayere, gúúk'at k'irts gizi meetsono maak'ayere, s'atsono maak'ayere, widatsnowere wokoore, jamkeewanotsatse it atso it kotal sheenge itk'aliti, jamon beewere.»<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Wosheetswotswere deen bok'rere Ans'oki maants boami, amantsuwotsnowere kakudek't wosheets work'atman boosh imbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Amantswotswere wosheets work'ato bonababor bitsi kúp'its woshmann ayidek' boon b́ geneúshi. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Yhudnat Silasn nebiyiwotsi boteshtsotse eshu eshuwotsi ay Ik'i keewon izt boon bokup'shi. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Yhudnat Silasn muk' aawwotssh manoke boteshiyakon amants eeshuwwotsoke deneyat boon woshtsuwotsok aanat boami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="ft">«Silasmó manoke oora b́geyiye.» ik ik yoots kishon guut'etswots 34 taawatstsan dabrakne. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>P'awlosnat Bernabasnowere eshu k'osh ayuwotsnton wotdek' Doonzo keewuts keewo danifets nabfetst muk' aawosh Ans'okitse boteshi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlosnat Bernabasn bok'aletsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Muk' aawwotsiyere hakon P'awlos Bernabassh «Wowe anaanar haniyere shin doonzo keewts keewo boosh noshishits kit jamwotsitse fa'a eeshuwuwotsi s'iilone, awuk'o bowottsok'onowere danonee» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Bernabasuwere Mark'osi eteetso Yohans bonton towaar bíamo b́ geyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Wosh. 13:13</ref> </char></note> P'awlosmó ashman bonton bíametuwok'o eekeratse, eek b́k'aztsonuwere bí P'nfiliyitse boatse k'aleyat b́ oortsonat fino maantsowere bonton amo b́ k'aztsoshe. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Manatse tuutson P'awlosnat Bernabas dagotse mooshi eeno b́tuure k'ale bowutsi, mansh Bernabas Mark'osi detsdek't markabon K'op'ros maants k'azbíami. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>P'awlosmó Silasi marat'b́dek'i, eeshuwotswere P'awlosi doonzo s'aatosh adaro beshidek't boimiyakon k'azbími. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Bíwere Ik'i moowuwotsi kup'ifere Soriyonat Kilk'iyi weeron b́beshi.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">T'imotiwos P'awlosnat Silasnton towaat bíamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>P'awlos Derbenat Lst'ra maants bíami, Lst'rn T'imotiwosi eteets amants jawets iko fa'e b́tesh, bínd ayhudiyi ash wotat amank krstiyani btesh, b́ nihmó Grik dats asha b́ tesh. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>T'imotiyos Lst'ronat Ik'oniyonitse fa'a eeshuwwotsokere sheeng shútso detsfe b́ teshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>P'awlos T'imotiyosi de'er amo b́getsotse manokere beyru ayhudiwotsatse tuutson gofo b́ ametuwok'o b́woshi, mank'o b́ k'aluwere bo T'imotiyos nih Giriki dats ash b́ woto bodantsotse bojangosha etniye. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>P'awlosnat Silasn kit kitotse beshefetst Iyerusalemn fa'a woshetswotsnat eenashuwotsn eteets nemo amantsuwotssh bodanifere b́teshi, finatsowere bojitsituwok'o boosh bogawifere bo teshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Mansh Ik' moowwots imnetiyon kup'bowutsi, botaawonúwere dabfere bí'amiri.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Mek'edoni datso maants bí ametuwok'o s'eegetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>P'awlosnat Silasn Isiyi datsatse Ik'i aap'o bokeewurawok'o S'ayn shayiro boosh b́ bazitsotse Frgyiyinat Gelatiyi daarok k'az bobeshi, <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Misiyi daarok bobodtsok'on Bitanimaants amoosh gawtni botesh, ernmó Iyesusko S'ayin shayro man maants boametuwok'o eekeratse. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Mansh Misya weeron beshat T'iroadi bo oot'iye. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Manoke t'ú Mek'edoni ash iko need'dek't «Mek'edoni maants kimr noon te'úwe!» ett bín b́ k'onfere bek'on b́bek'i. <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>P'awlos bek'man b́bek'iyakon manoor Mek'edoni maants amoosh no geyi, Man b́wotuwere Mek'edoni ashuwotsshowere doo shishiyo nodaniyituwok'o Doonzo noon b́ s'eegtsok'o nodani.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiyi Krstosn biamantsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>T'iroadiyere Markabats keshdek'at kááwon Samtrak'e maants noami, yaats guurok'on Nap'ule maants no ami. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Maniyere tuwat Filip'isyosits nobodi, Filip'isyus Mek'edonitse fa'a kit eenunat Rom dats ashuwots dets bodek'ts datsi b tesh, kitmanitsnowere muk' aawwotsi nobeshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Sanbati aawotsowere Ik' k'onosh boko'efok kitoniyere úratse fa'a foki gúrok noo ami, manoke bedek'at ko'edek'ts máátsuwotssh Ik'i aap'o nodaniyi. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Nokeewirman k'ebiru máátswotsitsere iku Tiyat'ros kitotse shuwetsu tahi biro jaakiru Lidiya eteets máátsu fa'a b teshi, biwere Ik' Ik'iru máátsiye b teshi, doonzo b nibo bish b́ k'eshtsotse P'awlos bíaap'iru b k'ebfere b teshi, <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Binat b meyitsi fa'a ash jamwots bo gupeyakon, «Doonzo ti amantso arik b́woto itkitsitka wotiyal waar t moots beewere,» etaat kup'idek'at noon b k'oni.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filp'syus kitotse P'awlosnat Silasn botipetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Ik aawu Ik' k'oneyiruwok noamfere shino maants wotit keewo keewit kim shayiro biyatse fa'a ik'ets Gon baarna'ú weerindatse noon b datsi, Gonmanuwere Ik'o oot'at b doonzotssh ay oot'o b datsifo b teshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Biwere noonat P'awlosn shuutso shoydek'at sha'at, «Ashaanots een Ik'o gutswotsiye! boowere kash weerindo itsh keewitúnee!» etaat b kuhefooni. <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Hanoewre ay aawosh aani aani bk'alfoni, P'awlosmó nibok'úúnwutsat wongr et aanat kiimshayirman «Iyesus Krstos shútson biatsotse nkeshetuwok'o neen azazere!» bí eti. Kim sharonuwere manoor k'azb́keshi.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Bin keezfwotswere b weeron bodatsit oot'o boatse k'ut'b́wtstsok'o bek'bok'rtsok'on P'awlosnat Silasn detsbodek'i, geetsferowere jebomaants dek'amt naashwots shinats t'intsbok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Rom dats naashuwotsokowere dek'wat hank'o boeti, «Ashaanots Ayhudi jírnee, no kitotsnowere dimbro botuziri, <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Noo Rom dats ashuwots dek'o nofalrawu niwo noosh bodaniyiri.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Ashjamonwere ik wotdek't boats b́tuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Naash naashuwotsuwere P'awlosnat Silasn taho sholbazt gumbon botogetuwok'o boazazi. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Ayidek't botogeyi hakon t'ip'moots kindsh bok'iri, tipi maa kotiruwonuwere k'up'ide boon b́kotetuwok'o azazk'reyi, <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Kotiruwo azazetsman b́dek'iyakon, tipi maaman gitsotsi kayuts boon kindsh b́k'ri, botufonowere gindonat gindi dagots detsidek't tipb́k'ri.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>T'ú Taali titso maantsowere P'awlosnat Silasn Ik' k'ononat dubon Ik'o údfetstni boteshi, tipeets k'oshuwotswere bóóna bok'ebiri botesh. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Gawerawonowere tipimaaman b́ned'oko b́gaahefetsosh een dats shek'eyo wotb́wtsi, fengesh jamwotswere k'eshebowutsi, tipetswotsi boon tipeets habiliyo ik ikon bish b́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Kotiruwonuwere b́tokrootse tuut tipimaa fengesuwots k'eshewutsat boere bek't tipetswots k'azbokeshtsok'o bísh bíarere b́ tooko úd'osh b́shiko kaas'b́dek'i, <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Ernmó P'awlos, «No no únetswor hanok noone! manshe ntokats gondofink'aye!» ett k'aar eenon b́kúhi.<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Manoor kotiruwo c'eesho de'eweetuwok'o wosht gitsots b́kindi, k'eewufetst P'awlosnat Silasn tufi shirots b́baron gúp'nb́wútsi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Úrats boon kishdekt «T Doonzotso! kashosh eegk'ale taan b́geyiyti?» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Bowere «Doonzo Ieyesusn amanowe, kashituwune, nmeyitsi ashuwotswere kashitúne» boeti. <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Doonzo aap'onowere bínat b́meyitse fa'a jamwotssh bokeewi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>manoori sa'aton t'úwon tipimo kotiruwo dek'amt bogaawo bo atse b́mashi, manoor bínat b́maa ash jamwots bogúpeyi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Maniyere hakon P'awlosnat Silasn b́mook dek'amt misho boosh b́t'intsi, Ik'onowere bí amantsosh b́meyitsi ashuwotsnton geneú b́wutsi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>B́ gatstsok'onowere naash naashuwots «Ash manots faksheewunee» ett polisuwotsi bowoshi.<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Tipi maa kotfonuwere «It it faksheetuwok'o naash naashuwots asho bowoshtsotse eshe keer jeenon ameree» ett Silassh b́keewi.<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>P'awlosmó «Rom datsi ashnowotefere nayiralon jebatse noon jot't tipimoots noon kindshrnee. Andowere tipi mootse ááshon nokeshetuwok'owe bok'aliri? Woteratse! bo botookon waar noon kishunee!» ett bíaani.<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Poliswots keewuman naash naashuwotssh bokeewi, naah naashuwotswere P'awlosnat Silasn Rom dats ashuwotsi bowoto bodantsok'on shatbowtsi. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Mansh waat naandrone ett aatt tipimootse boon kishbok'ri, kitmanitsnowere boametuwok'o boon bok'oni.<verse eid="ACT 16:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>P'awlosnat Silasnowere tipi mootse kesht Lidiy moots bokindi, manoknowere eshu eshuwotsi daatsdek't boon kup'sht kitmanowere faksht k'azbo ami.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Teselonk'eyitse P'awlosnat Silasnats waats kic'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>P'awlosnat Silasn Anfip'olisnat Ap'olon weeron beshat Teselonk'e maants boami, manoknowere ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni moo fa'ee b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>P'awlos maniyere shin b́ k'alfok'o ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni moots b́ kindi, keez gawuyiwoshowere b́k'ut'raawon S'ayin mas'aafotse ash ashosh kish kitsfetstni b́ danifo. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Krstos gond bek'o de'er k'irotse tuwo bín b́geyituwok'o kitsit danifetst «Taa itsh b́ jangosh doo tshishyiru Iyesus Krstosiye» bíetfera b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Mann boyitse ik ikuwots b́ aap'o t'iwintsdek't P'awlosnat Silasnton ikbowoti, mank'owere Ik' Ik'iruwotswere aydek't ayts Ik'i ash woterawwots, kitutse daneets ay máátsuwots b́ aap'o t'iwintsdek't bínton ik bowoti.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Ayhudiwotsmó okoort fay tizitu fin deshawwotsi weer weeratse kakudek't tuuz bok'ri. Kitutse fayo b́tuwitwok'o bo woshi, P'awlosnat Silasn kishde'er ash ashosh imosh Iyason moo guurbodeki. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Ernmó boon bo t'ut'tsok'oon Iyasonnat amants ik ikuwotsi kitmanitsi naashuwotssh t'intsosh geetsfere dek't boami, hank'o etfetst bokuhiri boteshi, «Hanots datsjamo gaak rne ando hanok waarnee! <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Iyasonwere boon dek't ibiree, ‹Iyesusi eteets k'osh nugúso fa'ee› ett Rom Naashi Naasho alo bok'efiri.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Ash ashonat kitutsi naash naashuwots man boshishtsok'on dimbr bowutsi <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Iyasonnat k'oshuwotsn wusho s'eegiyit fakshbokri.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlosnat Silasn Beriyitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Eshu eshuwots P'awlosnat Silasn káári t'úwon Bery maants bo amtuwok'o bowoshi, Manok bo bodtsok'on ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni moots bokindi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Beriyan fa'a ayhudiyots Teselonk'en fa'wotsiyere bogo kááwu finek boteshtsotse b́ aap'o gene'úwi eenon bodek'i, b́ aap'o ar b́ wotok'o kitsosh aawu aawon S'ayn mas'afotsi bos'ilfoni. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Mansh boyitsere ayuwots boamani, ay Grik datsatsi gaaletswots máátswots ay Grik datsatsi nungushuwots boamani. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Ernmó Teselok'en fa'a ayhudiyots P'awlos Beriyon Ik'i keewuts keewo b́ nabiruwok'o bodantsok'on manoor waat ashuwotsi gondon tizt bowaac'rituwok'o botizi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Manoor eshu eshuwots káári P'awlos aats k'ari ganok b́ ametuwok'o bowoshi Silasnat T'imotiyosnmó manoke Beriyon bo oori. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>P'awlosi deents ashuwots Ateni bobetsi «Silasnat T'imotoyosn ja'araniye káári tiyok woonee» etiru P'awlos tzaziyo detsdek't Beriyo maants boaani.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Atenitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>P'awlos Atenon wotdek't Silasnat T'imotiyosn b́ kotfere kitutsere dozets ik'uwots bos'entsok'o b́bek'tsotse ayidek't nibo b́k'uni. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Mansh ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse ayhudiyotsnat Ik'osh Ik'iru ashuwotsnton jebatse aawu aawon b́ daatsiru ashuwotsnton b́mooshiri b́tehi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Epikorosotsnat Istokotsi eteets bog danetuwots b́ maants waatni bomooshfoni. Ik ikuwots «Ooshiyiruwan eeg etee b́geyi?» bo etor, k'oshuwotsmó «Handr ik'uwots janga arefee b́ keewiri? boetiri, man boetiruwere P'awlos Iyesusnat k'irotse b́tuwi doo shishi keewi jango b́ danitsoshe. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Mansh P'awlosi detsdek't Ariyosfagosi eteets beyokoke kakuwets ash ashok dek'wat bísh hank'o boeti, Nee ndaniyiru handr danan eeg b́wottsok'o dano falituwonowáá? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Ib wotts ik ik keewwotsi noosh shiyirnee, mansh keewanots eeg bowottsok'o dano geefone.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Man etts Atenitse beyirwotsnat Atenitse beyiru úridatsi ash jamwots handr keewu keewonat k'eboke bogizeyo beshiyo boshunfotsne.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Manoor P'awlos Aryosfagosn kakweetswots shinatse need'dek't hank'o bíet, «Ateen ashuwotso! jam weeron ayidek'at ik'uwotsi shatiru itwottsok'o t'iwintsdek'at dandek're, <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>It kitotse gúúrat ananat it Ik' it ik'irwoko t s'iile ‹Danerawo Izar Izeweri› ett guut'etsoko wosh biyatse t'intseyiru t'arap'ezo daatsre, eshe taa and itsh t keewir it danawo bín it ik'iruwo Izar Izewer jangoniye. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Bíye Datsonat datsatse fa'a jamo aztsoniyee, Daronat datsonsh doonze, bíye ash kishon ageets Ik'i moots beerake, <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24-25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Naash. 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa. 42:5</ref> </char></note> Kashonat kash jongon, k'osh keewwotsnowere ash jamosh imfo bí b́wottsotse bísh eegor shaprake, asho bín b́ tep'onowere bísh geyiratse. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Bíye ash naar jamone ik ashaatse azree, dats jamatsnowere bo beetuwok'o woshre, tiitsets duruwotsnat beyokuwotsnowere boosh b́ beezi. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Man b́ k'aluwere ashuwots doonzo geeyar daatso bofalituwok'owe, b́wotiyalor bí no ik iketsatse woka etaliye.<verse eid="ACT 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>‹Kasho daatsir nogiwit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">Noo beetuwere bíne,›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Manuwere itk wotts jááwetswots</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‹Noo noúnets b́ nana' noone› bo ettsok'onee.<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Eshe noo b́ nana'a nowotiyakon ‹Ik'o ash danon, hasabiyon awntson wee ambaron wee shútson dozets aroniye bíari› err gawo noosh geyiratse. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Eshe ashuwots yoots dúr dáron bok'altso Ik'o kabiraniyere k'az beshere, andomó dats datsatse fa'a ash jamwots naandrone boetetuwok'o azazere, <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Bí b́marat'ts asho weeron dats jamatse arikon b́angshit aawo beezdek're, hanowere jametsosh daniyidek't b́bek'sh b́marat'ts ashman k'irotse b́tuztsotsnee.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>«K'irotse tuuwa» etiru aap'o boshishtsok'on ik ikuwots bín boaatsni, k'oshuwotsmó «Han jango k'osh aawots nkeewure k'ebetuwonee» boeti. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Maniyere hakon P'awlos kakuwets ashuwotsoke kesht k'az bíami, <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Ash ik ikuwotsmó bínton ik wotat boamani, amants ashuwotsitsnowere Aryosfagosn kakuwetsuwotsitso Diyonasyosi eteets ashonat Demarisi eteets mááts ikunu, k'oshuwotswere boyitse fa'ano.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos K'orontositse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Maniyere hakon P'awlos Atenitse tuut K'orontosi bíami, <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Manoke P'ant'os datsatse shuwek wottso Ak'ili eteetso Ayhudi ash iko b́daatsi, Rom naashi naasho K'elawudiwos Ayhudi jamo Romitse bokeshetuwok'o azazat b́ teshtsotse Ak'il b́ máátsu P'rsk'lntoon It'aaliyitse manoora b́waa, mann P'awlos book amt bonton b́daneyi, <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>B́fiino ari bokok'o dunkani shipo b́teshtsotse bonton towaat beedek'tn b́fiinefo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Sanbati aaw aawonowere ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse datseyar mooyr ayhudiwotsnat Grik dats ashuwots keewman bo dek'etwok'o b́wooshfoni.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Silasnat T'imotiwosn Mek'odonitse bowatsok'on P'awlos «Iyesusye Mesihyoniye» eton ayhudiwotssh kup'dek't gawefetst daniyoke bíaawu jamo b́beshifoni b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Ernmó bín k'efat boc'ashor b́ tahatsi k'úndo tebatt «Eshe itats angsheyal it took t'afiyonee! taan bítse aateratse, haniyak Ik' ash woterawwotsok k'ay ametuwe!» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Mann boatse k'aleyat Titos Iyost'osi eteets asho mook k'azbiami, ashaan Ik'o Ik'if asha b́tesh, b́moonwere ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mooniyere beshaatni b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>K'ersp'osi eteefo ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni maa jishiruwo b́meytsi ash jamonton Doonzo bíamani, ay K'orontos ashuwotswere P'awlos b́ keewufere shisht amanat bogúpeyi.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Doonzonuwere t'ú bek'on P'awlossh hank'o bíeti, «Shatk'aye, keewwe, s'k etk'aye, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>Taaye neentonye tfa'oni, kitanitsere ay asho tdetstsotse gondo niyats betsosh falituwo konuworu aaliye.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Mansh P'awlos Ik' aap'o ashuwotssh danifere ik natonat badosh manoke b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Galiyos Akayiya datso altsi wotat b́ naashor ayhudiyots ik wotdek't P'awlosats botuwi, angshituwots shinatso bín dek'amt, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>«Ashaan Muse nemo b́ k'efts weratse ashuwots Ik'o bo ik'ituwok'o b́ woshiri!» boeti. <verse eid="ACT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>P'awlos boosh aaniyosh k'andek't b́befere Galyos ayhudiwotssh hank'owa bíet, «It Ayhudi jirwotso! itats gondo wee weralo finere wotink'ere it t'intsts s'aamiyo k'amde tk'ebank'oni b́teshi, <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Ernmó aap'uwotsnat shúts jango it nemi jangosha it mooshiri wotiyal man it took kis'e, taa keewanotsats angshosh geeratse.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Hank'o ett moosh mooshiruwoke boon b́kishi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Manoor jamwots ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni maa jishiruwo Sostensn detsdek'et angishiruwots shinatse boojot'i, jaman b́wotefere Galyos kis'odeshatse.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Ans'okiy maants bíantsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Taaw. 6:18</ref> </char>
    </note> P'awlos eshuwotsnton ay aawosh K'orontosi b́teshiyakon jamiyere Soriyo maants bíami, P'irsk'lnat Ak'iln bíntoni boteshi, ernmó wosho b́detstsotse bíamoniyere shinon Knkiriya eteyiru datsatse b́tooko b́ s'ageyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Efesoni bobodtsok'ono P'rsk'lonat Ak'ilon manoke oori bok'ri, bímó Ayhudi Ik' k'oni moots kindt ayhudiyotssh keewo b́ keewufoni. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Ay aawosh bonton b́teshetuwok'o bok'oniyalor eekeratse. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Ernmó «Ik'o bí eteetka wotiyal k'oshoor itok aanarr weetuwe» etk'raat Efesonitsere markabots kinddek't k'azbíami.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>K'isarimaantsowere b́bodtsok'on maniyere Iyerusalem maants kesht Ik'i meyitsi ashuwotssh jamo b́ t'intsiyakon aanat Ans'okiyi maants k'az b́ oot'i. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Manoknowere muk'i b́teshi, maniyere hakon Gelatiynat Frgiy datsatse ikoke tuut ikok gúúrefetst amantsuwotsi b́ kup'iyi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ap'los Efesonnat K'orontositse b́danitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Iskndri datsatse shuwetso Ap'losi eteets Ayhudi asho Efesoni b́weyi, bí S'ayin mas'aafwotsi t'iwintsdek't dankoonat noon keewonowere sheengshdek't keewo falk asha b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Doonzo weerindi jangonowere dandek't S'ayin shayronowere aat'k wotat Iyesus jangonowere kaatsdek' nabfetst b́danifoni, wotowa eree bí b́danfo Yohans gupo s'uzi b́tesh. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Bí ááwushuk'on ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse keewo dek't b́tuwi, ernmó P'rsk'ilnat Ak'iln b́ keewiruwo boshishtsok'on bo gal dek'amt Ik'i weero baltsoniyere bogo kaatsdek bitsdek't bísh bokitsi. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Ap'los Akayiyo maants amoosh b́gawtsok'oon eshuwots b́keewuman botep'i, Akayiyitse fa'a eshuwots bí sheengon de'er boibituwok'o work'atats guut'ets wosho woshbok'ri, manok b́bodtsok'oonowere Ik'i s'aaton amantsuwotsi wotosh bodtswotsi ayidek' b́ tep'i. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Iyesus Mesihiyo b́wotsok'o S'ain mas'afwotsitse Ik' aap'o biitsdek' keewut kup'ts mooshon ayhudiwotsi b́ da'afoni.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Efesonitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Ap'los K'orontositse b́teshor P'awlos danbani datson beshat Efeson maants b́bodi, manokno muk' Krstaniyotsi daatsdek't <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>«It amanor S'ayn shayiro dek'rteya b́teshi?» ett bíaati. Bowere «De'atsone, S'ayn shayiro b́beyonoru dab shish danaak noone» ett bo aani.<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>P'awlosu «Eshe aawu naari gúpe it gúpetsoni?» bí eti. Bowere «Yohanis gúponiye» boeti.<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 3:11">3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk'. 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Yoh. 1:26-27</ref> </char>
    </note> P'awloswere «Yohans guponiyere naandrone etosh k'aleke, ash ashosh b́keewutsonuwere ‹Taayere il wetuwonee amanore› etfetstni b́tesh, bíwere Iyesusiye» etreboosha.<verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Man boshishtsok'on Doonzo Iyesus shútson bogupeyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>P'awlosu b́ kisho boats b́gedor S'ayin shayiro boats b́ od'eehandr noon keewon bokeeweyi, bek'ono keewo dek'tbotuwi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Ash jamwotswere tatse gitne boteshi. <verse eid="ACT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>P'awlos ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mook amt keez shashok'owosh Ik' mengst jangosh mooshfetst ash ashuwotssh kish keewut ááwu shuk'ona b́ danifoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Ik ikuwotsmó maac' kup'o wotat doonzo weerindo ashuwots shinatse c'ashfetst amaneratsone boettsosh boatse k'azb́woki, amantsuwots boaali T'iranosi eteef maa eenok dek'amt aawu aawon boon b́danifoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>P'awlos hank'o b́k'al git natok'osha, manoor Isiy datsatse beyiru ayhudiyotsnat Ik' ashwoterawwotsn doonzo aap'o shisho bofali.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o P'awlos kishon b́fiinst adits keewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Ik'o ayidek't adits keewu wotts milikituwotsi P'awlos kishon b́finefoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Manatse tuutson P'awlos atsats bodts tahonat marabon dek'amt shodetsuwotsats bobetsor boshodotse bokashefoni, kim shayirwotswere boyitse bokeshfoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Fo'erawono ashaatse kishfetst ikoke tuut ikok guuriru Ayhudi ik ikuwots «P'awlos b́ nabiruwo doonzo Iyesus shútson it kesheetuwok'o iti azazerone» eton fo'erawo ashaatse kishosh bo etfoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Ayhudiwots kahinwotsatsi naasho wottso Ask'ewu nana'a shawatuwotswere mank'owa bok'alfo.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Ernmó kim shayiro «Iyesusi danfee! P'awlosnor danfee! Eshe it konots itne?» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Kim shayiro bíatse s'eents ash ikonwere t'oolat gúúk' dek'on boats b́kup'i, bonowere da'ab́dek'i, gaawutnuwere araatswtsaat meyitse giifat bokeshi. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Keewumanuwere Efesonitse beyiru ayhudiwotsnat Ik' ash woterawotsoke b́ shishetsotse jametso shatb́wtsi, Doonzo Iyesus shútsonowere ayi eenb́wutsi. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Amantsuwotsitse ayuwotsuwere bogond fino kish keewut naandrone err bowaafoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Atetswotswere bodaniyi mas'aafwotsi kakudek't ash ashi shinatse mitsbok'ri, mas'afmanoots k'awuntsonuwere taanere balk'ats kum ambari katso wotatni b́daatsiyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Mank'oon doonzo keewo ayidek't gawunfetst da'afera bí amfo b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efesonitse dimbiro b́tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Jaman b́wotiyakon P'awlos Mek'edonitsnat Akayiyiweeron beshat Iyerusalem maants amoosh b́gitsoon gawuk'rat «Manok t bodiyakon Rom maants amo taash geyife» bíetí. <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Mann Ik'i fino finiru ashuwotsitse gitetsuwotsi, T'imotiwosnat Erast'osn Mek'edoni maants woshat bí b́tookon Isiyi datsatse muk' aawosh b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Manoor doonzo weeri jangosh Efesonitse dimbiro tuub́wtsi. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Dimet'rosi eteef ambaar wos'if iko Art'emisn ik' maa aro ambaron doozt ambaar wos'iyiruwotssh ay oot'o b́daatsifoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Mansh ashaan ambaar wos'iyiruwotsnat bo fini naari fin detsts k'osh ashuwtsi kakudek't boosh hank'o bí eti «It ashuwotso! Noo gaalo nodaatsir finan finat b́wottsok'o danfte, <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>P'awlosan ‹Ash kishon dozets aranots Izar Izewerotsiyaliye› ett Efeson s'uzitse b́woterawo muk' datsuniyere okoon Isiyi dats jamatse awuk'o ayts ashonton keweek'rat bí amanitsok'o it it tookon bek'aat it shishtsoniye. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Eshe hank'on nofino b́ gac'ewoniye, manmec'ro b́woterawon Isiyotsnat dats jamatse ash jamo bin b́ ik'yiru een izar izewer Art'emis Ik'i moo dats baashon b́ ooroniye, bi een wotonwere b́wonewoniyee.»<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Ashuwotswere man boshishtsk'on fayat, «Efesontsu Art'emisiye eeniye!» etfetst bokuhi. <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Kitunuwere jamon shek'e bwutsi, ashuwotswere Mek'odoni datsatse shuwets P'awlosnton tohaat sha'iru b́ tooh gituwots Gayyosnat Arst'rokosn detsdek't geetsfere ash ashuwots bokoeyiruwok bowos'i. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>P'awloswere ashuwotsok amoosh geyatni b́tesh, b́ danifuwotsmó bíamawok'o bobazi. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Isiy datsatsi naashuwotsitswere b́shuntsuwotsitsi ik ikuwotsi P'awlosok asho woshat «Ashuwots ko'eyiruwok amr n be'erawok'owa» ett bok'oni. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Ashuwots dagotse wac'ro b́teshtsotse aywots eegosh bokoetsok'o dab danatsno b́teshi, man jangosh iko ik keewo keewt b́kuheere k'oshonuwere k'osh keewo keewut b́kuhiri. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ik ik Ayhudi jirwots Iskndiri eteets asho ash dagotsere gifnidek't shinats bot'ntsi, ashuwotsitse ik ikuwots sheengshde'ere b́moshetuwok'o boizi, Iskendiruwere ashuwots s'k boetetuwok'o b́kishon kitst bín kishit keewosh k'anb́dek'i. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Ernmó Iskendr Ayhudi b́wotok'o ash jamwots bodantsok'on «Efesontsu Art'emis eeniye!» et fetst git sa'atok'osh ik k'aaron bokuhi.<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>B́s'uwatse kitutsi guut'f naash eeno, ash asho s'k boaayituwok'o wosht hank'o bíeti, «It Efeson ashuwotso! Efeson kitutse beyiruwots, eenu Art'emis ik' moonat darotse oot'ts bí'aro bokotetuwok'owo jametsuwotsoke daneke. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Han haalitwo konuwor bíaaltsotse s'k it eteetuwok'o, kááronowere gond keewo k'aloniyere it atso kor itdek'tuwok'o geyife. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Ik'i moo c'ayawotsnat noko Izar Izeweri c'ayawu gond keewono keewuraw ashuwotsi hanok dek'at waartee. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Dimet'rosnat bínton fa'a k'is' k'is'fuwotsi s'aamiru asho b́beyalowere angsh imet aawwots fa'ane, naashuwotsuwere fa'ane, manoke mooynee. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>K'osho it geyiru keewo b́beyaalmó nemon k'oorosh beyiruwotsn s'iiletuwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Maniyere okoonmó hambets k'aleets keewo ‹Dimbiro tuuzre› err no s'aamirawok'owa shatituwe, ‹Baad'eyan eegatsneya b́tuwi› err noon aatewor no aaniyituwo deshatsone» <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Manowere ett kakuwets ashuwots bobad'ituwok'o b́woshi.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Mek'edoniyonat Grik datsats b́sha'atsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Dimbro b́ neediyakon P'awlos amantsuwotsi ikok s'eegt izon boon b́kup'iyi, boon jamik'ratnuwere Mek'edoni eteets datso maantsan bíami. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>B́ beshiru datsmanotsatsno amantsuwotsi ay izon kup'ifere Grik datso maants bíami. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Manokno keez shasho b́ teshi, maniyere hakon markabon Soriy datso maats amoosh b́gawi, ayhudiyitsmó bín fayosh botutsok'o b́dantsotse Mek'edoni weeron anoosh k'ut'b́dek'i.<verse eid="ACT 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>P'irhus naay Sop'at'ros Beriyotse, Arst'rokosnat Sikondusn Teselonk'en, Gayyosn Derben, T'imotiwos, Tikik'osnat T'rofimosn Isiyon bínton tohaat boami. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Bowere shin shino amt T'iroadn noon bokoti. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Noomó tush meyet baalio b́ beshiyakon Filp'isyusitse Markabats keshat úúts aawon bo bobeyiruwok T'iro'adayits bodat bíyokere shawat aawo nobeshyi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos ili T'iroadn b́ nabtso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Torbanotsere shnts aawots misho tishde'er iknon moowosh nokakweyi, P'awlos yats gúrok'on bíametwootse ko'ets ashuwotssh b́ keewiri, b́ keewono talitiitso b́borfetso b́geezi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>No no ko'ets dadratse ay c'eesho fa'e b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Ewut'ek'isi eteets jawets na'iko meskotiyatse beedek'tniye b́ teshi, P'awlos b́ keewo b́ geezitsotse jawetsman tokri eeno detsb́dek'i, tokro bín b́ datsotse keezl dadratsere dashan b́dihi, ashuwots bok'awere k'irt b́datseyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Ernmó P'awlos oot't na'ats tuumt matdek't «And kashone b́ fa'oni bíeti, tek'k'ayere!» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>P'awlos dadrats aani kesh waat misho tiitsdek't amantsuwotsnton b́meyi, datso b́gatsfetsosh ashuwotsnton keewefetst b́teshiyakon k'azbíami. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ashuwotswere kashts jawetso moots dek'boami, mannowere ayidek't kup'bowutsi.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos T'iro'aditse Milit'i maants bíamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>P'awlosi markabots kindshosh nogawutsatse noo shinat markabots Asosits noami, man nok'aluwere P'awlos Asosits b́borfetso b́ tufoon amoosh bí ettsosh hank'o no k'alituwok'o noon b́ azaztsotsne. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Bínton Asositse nogonkewor markabots bín kindshdek' milit'its maants towaat noami. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Yaats guurok'on manoke tuwat Kiyositse shinatse fa'a datsuwats markabon amnobodi, yaatsok'o Samos maants kimaat yaats guurok'on Milit'iyits amnobodi. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>P'awlos Isiyotse t teyawok'wa ett Efesoniyere beshat k'ay amo b́ geyi, man b́ k'aluwere P'ent'ek'ost'yi baaliyo Iyerusalemitse daatseyo gawut b́teshtsotsna b́tesh.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efeson Ik' máá eenashuwotsi P'awlos b́s'egitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>P'awlos Milit'itsere Efeson maants asho woshat Ik'i maa eenashuwotsi b́ s'eegiyi, <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Bíyok bowatsok'on boosh hank'o bíeti, «Isiyots tkindts aawotstson tuut jam aawo itnton awuk'o tbeetsok'o itwoor danfte, <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ayhudiwots tiats bo malts k'od'atse tuutson gondbek'o tiats b́bodaloru ttooko dashan detsonat eeponee doonzo fino t finefoni. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Jebatsnowere it maa mootsnowere itsh tdaniyor itsh t'ak'amitu jamoni tkeewi bako eegoru itsh t shapitso aaliye. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Ayhudiyotsi wotowa Ik' ash woterawwots naandrone err Ik'o maants bo aanituwok'o doonzo Iyesus Krstosi bo amanituwok'oye b́gawi. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Andoor bíyok tbodor tiyats bodetwo eeg b́wto t dartsotse s'ayn shayirosh aleyat Eyerusalem maats ti amoniye. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Wotowa eree kit kitotse tipewonat gond bek'on taan b́kotiruwok'o S'ayin shayiro taash keewure. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 T'im. 4:7</ref> </char></note> Doo shishi keewo Ik' s'aaton daniyosh doonzo Iyesusoke t k'aaútdek'ts fino tishink'ere t kashi jango k'awuntsots gerawunk'e, t kashoshowere kis'o deshawnk'e.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>«Andish b́borfetso it jamets dagotse ananat Ik'i mengsti jango t nabiri, haniyere okonomó ititsere konuworu t shiitso b́ jamon b́ be'awok'o danfee. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Mansh ititsere ikdonzworu b́t'afiyal b́ s'atsotse taan aaterawok'o hambets aawon itsh danirwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Ik'o bí'asabts jamo itsh keewuni tishi bako eegoru t oorits keewo aaliye. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>S'ayn shayiro jintswotsi woshdek't iti naashire, eshe it tokonat it jiniru gizi s'eeni jangosh it atso korde'ere, Ik'o b́ naay s'atson keewudeb́k'ts Ik'i moo korere. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Taa ti amiyakon gizi s'eenosh máác' k'ewerawo elahok'o maac' kup' wotts ashuwots bits bokindituwok'o danfee. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Mank'owore ash ik ikwots ititse tuur k'úúr daniyo daniyir ayi amantsuwotsi bomaants geetsitune. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Eshe it ik iketsi keez natosh t'úwonat aawon ti aac'uwo kuut'fetsat itn ti'iztsok'o gawufetsr itatso korde'ere.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>«Andoor iti kup'shr S'ayinwots dagotse rstiyo imosh falitu b́s'aati aap'onshowere adaro iti imre. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Taa kon ambaaronowere, awntsonowere wee taho tewunratse. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>T took kishon finefetsat ttooko wotowa ttohuwotsi t tep'fok'o it tookon danfte. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>‹Dek'iruwoniyere bogo imiruwo deereke› etiru doonzo Iyesus aap'tso gawufetsr, nokishon angmaawtswotsi tep'o noosh b́ geyituwok'o ay weerindon itsh kitsre.»<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Maniyere hakon P'awlos jametsuwotsnton tuk'maldek't Ik'o b́k'oni. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Jametsuwots eept P'awlosi matdek't bojoobi. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Dabtnu aydek't shiyanatnuwere, «Haniyak tshitso be'atste» boosh bí'ettsatse tuutsone, Markabok b́ borfetsosho bín bodeni.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Iyerusalem maants bíamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Boo'atse nok'aleyakon Markabats keshdek'at kawon K'osi eteets ats k'aron gúrts datsuk noami, yats gúúrok'on Rúdi eteets ats k'aron gúrts datsuk nobodi, manokno P'at'ray eteets kitots no'ami. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Manokno Fink'e datso maants amiru Markabu daatsat bíyats keshdek'at sha'osh notuwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>K'op'ros aats k'aron gúrts datsu nogiro maants k'azk'rat Sori datso maants amaat Tiros aats k'ari gúroki datsuk no'ami, markabunwere bkuro manok orsho bín geyfe bteshi. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Manokere amantsuwotsi geeyat nodatsiyakon bonton shawat aawosh manoke noteshi. Bowere S'ayn shayiron jisheyat P'awlossh «Iyerusalem maants amk'aye» ett bokeewi. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Manoke no ja'ats aawman b́ s'uwutsok'on boatse k'aleyat sha'o notuwi, jametsuwotsuwere bomááts máátsonat bonana'uwotsnton wotat kitoniyere nokeshfetso noon bodeni, aats k'ari gúrats tuk'maldek'at Ik'o no k'oniyakon nok'aleyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>No jamiyakon no markabots no nokindre bo bomoo maants k'az bo aani.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>T'rositse tuwat P'et'elemays maants nobodi, manokno amantsuwotsnton gonkeyat jamo no'ateyakon bonton ik aawo nojini. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Wosh. 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref> </char></note> Yaats guurok'on manokere keshat K'isariyo maants no'ami, bíyokno shawat Dak'oniyotsitsere ik wottso doo shishiyo nabiruwo Filp'os meyits kindat bínton nobeyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Bíwere bek'on keewo boosh imets awd baar nana'a mááts amawwotsi detsfe b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Ay aawosh manokere nobemanoor Agabosi eteets Nebiyo Yhud datsatse b́weyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Nebiyanuwere nook t'int, P'awlos edo k'aaúdek't b́ took kishonat b́tufuwotsi tipt «S'ayin shayiro eedan doonzi Iyerusalemn fa'a ayhudiyots hank'o tifde'er Ik' ash woterawwotssh beshide'er imetune etfe» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Man noshishtsok'on noowere manoke fa'a ashuwotswere P'awlos Iyerusalem maants bíamawok'o nok'oni. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>P'awlosmó «Hank'o eepat eegishe tnibo shiyanon it tiitsiri? Taa doonzo Iyesus shúts jangosh Iyerusalemitse tipee mec'r b́woterawo k'irosh k'andek'ktaane» ett bíaani.<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Bo izono de'atse bíere «Beree doonzo bíettsok'o wotowe» etaat k'aznok'iri.<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Manokno muk' aawwotssh noteshiyakon nok'ac'o k'anidek'at Iyerusalem maants noami. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>K'isariyitse fa'a amants ik ikuwots noonton tohaat boweyi, boowere Mnason meyts nokashdek'etwok'o b́moo maants noon bojishi, ashaamanwere shini amantso K'op'ros datsatse shuweke b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Iyerusalemitse Yak'obnton bogonketsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Iyerusalemits nobodtsok'on amantsuwots geneúwon noon bodek'i. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Yaats guurok'on P'awlos noonton Yak'obok bíami, Ik'i maa eenash jamwots manokna botesh. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>P'awlos jametsuwotsi jamo b́aatiyakon b́weeron Ik'o Ik' ashwoteraw ashuwotsitse b́k'alts jamo ik ikon b́ keewi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Man boshishtsok'on jametsuwots doonzo boúdi, P'awlosshowere hank'o boeti, «Eshuwonoo! ay kumon taawetu amantsuwots ayhudiwotsitse bo beyiruwok'onat jametsuwotswor bo nemosh okooretsuwotsi bowottsok'o danfnee, <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">11:28</ref> </char></note> Nee Ik' ash Woteraw ashuwotsitse beyiru ayhudiyi jamwotssh ‹It nanaúwotsi gofo damik'ayere wee nemok'o fink'ayere› etaat daniyat Muse nemo b́ gahituwok'o nk'aliri ett keeweyirwo bo shishrne. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Eshe eeg k'ale b́ geyiyiti? n woono arikon shishrne, <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23-24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Taaw. 6:13-21</ref> </char></note> Eshe no no'etetuwo k'aluwe, noyitse wosho detsts awd ashuwots fa'ane. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Boon de'amr bonton wotar ntooko s'ayintsuwe, botook s'iiro bos'agetuwok'o Ik' moosho imet mebi gizono nee boosh daye, hank'o n k'aliyal níats keewets jamo k'awuntsalk b́wottsok'onat neewere n tookon Muse nemosh alek nwottsok'o jametsuwots danetunee. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Wosh. 15:29</ref> </char></note> Ik' ashwoterawwots jirwotsitse amantsuwotsmó Woteraw ik'osh b́ t'intsotse kiimts woshi misho maak'ayere, s'atsonowere maak'ayere, guuk'at k'irts gizi meetso maak'ayere, widats wokoore ett guutt'eets keewu detsts woshi work'ato guut'dek'at itsh wosherone.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Maniyere hakon P'awlos ashuwotsi dek'amt yaats guurok'on b́tooko b́s'ayintsi, bos'ayinet aawwots awur bo s'uwitwok'onat ik ikuwots jangoshowere Ik'osh imet mabi gizo b́ dashet gizwo awur b́wottsok'o daniyosh Ik'i moots b́kindi.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Ik'i mootse b́detseetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Shawt aawu manu beshosh b́t'intsk'on Isiyon waats ayhudiyots P'awlosi Ik'i mootse bobek'tsosh ash jamo bíyats tizt bín bodetsi, <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>«Israe'el ashuwotso! noosh gaatsowere! no ashonat no nemon, beyokanowere c'ashfetst dats datsatsi ash jamonowere daniruwo ashaaniye, hanuwere boratse ett Ik' ash woteraw ashuwotsi Ik' moots kindsht s'ayin beyokan k'imhsre!» ett bokuhi. <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Wosh. 20:4</ref> </char></note> Hano boetuwere maniyere shin Efesonn shuwetso T'rofimos bínton kitotse bek't boteshtsoosh P'awlos bín Ik' moots dek't b́kindtsok'o boosh bíarernee.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Kit jamunwere dimbir bwutsi, ash jamonuwere wos'fere ikwotdek't waat P'awlosi detsdek't geetsfere Ik'i mootse bokishi, Ik'i maa fengeshuwotswere iknun is'ebowutsi. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Ashuwots P'awlosi úd'osh bogeetsok'on «Iyerusalem kitu bjamoon dimbir bwutsi» etiru wosho Rom datsatsi kes' naashok b́bodi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Mansh bí kes'fuwotsnat bali naashuwotsi b́shuutsats jishdek't ashuwots maants kaari wos'fere bíami. Ashuwotswere kes'fuwotsnat boon jishiruwon bobek'tsok'on P'awlosi jot'o k'azbok'iri. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Jishiruwonuwere P'awlosok t'int detsdek't git habliyon b́tipetuwok'o bíazazi, maniyere hakon koni b́wottsok'onat eeg b́k'altsok'owo danosh geeyat bíaati. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Ash ashonwere ik ikwots ik keewo boere k'oshuwotsuwere k'osh keewa boetfera botesh, azazirumanwere ash ash kuhatse tuutson ari keewo dano b́maawtsotse P'awlosi kes' kes'fuwots kot bokotiru gimbiyok de'er boametuwok'o bí azazi. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>P'awlos bíyats need'dek' dambaan kesheyirwok b́bodtsok'on ash jamo ayidek't b́faytsatse tuutson gondo biats betsosh bogeyiruwosh kes' kes'fuwots bín kurdek't k'azboami. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Ash ashonwere «Bín úd'ewe» etfere b́shuutso bosha'i.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos boosh keewudek't aaniyi b́dek'tsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Kes' kes'fuwots bo koti gimbiyok bín kindshosh bot'intsok'on P'awlos kes'iruwots abaatse alirwoh «Ik keewo neesh t keewituwok'o eekituneya taasha?» bí eti. Altsmanuwere «Grik dats noon keewu keewo danfiya? bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Eshe, and karnon fayo tizat awd kum kash úd'tswotsi woruwo maants dek't t'afts Gbs' asho nenalneya?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>P'awloswere «Taa Kilk'iyitse fa'a daneek wotts T'erses kitutse shuwets Ayhudi ash taane, oona neesha ashuwotssh t keewituwok'o taash eekowe» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>B́ keewituwok'o b́ ektsok'on P'awlos bíyatsneedeyiruwats need'dek't ash ashuwots s'ik boetetuwok'o b́kali, ash asho s'ik boettsok'on Ibrayist'iyi noon keewon hank'o ett keewo dek'btuwi.<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>«Ti eeshuwotsnat tnihotso! eshe and itsh tt'intsiru aani tdek'etuwo tiko k'ewere!» <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Ibrayist'i noon keewu keewon b́ keewufere boshishtsok'on iki s'k etbowtsi, P'awloswere b́keewiru keewo b́ need'irawo hank'o bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Wosh. 5:34-39</ref> </char>
    </note> «Taa Kilk'iyitse daatseyiru T'erses kitotse shuwets ayhudiwi taane, tieenmó Iyerusalem Kitmanitsne. Taan danifonuwere Gemalyailiye b́teshi, nih nihwots nemono shengshdek'at danre, hambets it k'aliruwank'o Ik'osh ookorona tfinefoni. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Krstni imneti shuuts sha'iryiru jamwotsi k'irosh borfetso t gishfoni, nungushuwotsnat máátsuwotsn tifde'er tipi moots bokindituwok'o twoshfoni. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4-5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Wosh. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref> </char></note> Manuwere ar b́wottsok'o kahni naashonat eenashuwots taash gawitune. Eshe Demask'on fa'a ashaanotsi tifde'er Iyerusalem maants dewar boon Seziyosh taan falituwo Demask'on fa'a jirwotsoke guut'ets worek'ato tdek'iye boowokne.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Krstos maants awuk'on bíantsok'o b́keewutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Wosh. 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>«Taa Demask'o maants amfetsat kituk tt'infere aawu taalon t gawuraniyere een shááno darotse t gúratse b́goli. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Manoor dattsats dihi twutsi, ‹Sawulo! Sawulo! eegishe taan ngishiri?› etiru k'aaro tshshi. <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Taawere ‹Doonzono! kone nee?› t eti, bíwere ‹Taahe nee ngishiruwo Nazrettso Iyesus taane› bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Taanton beyiru ashuwotswere shaanmani bobek'i bako taan b́keewiyor b́k'aaro shiyatsne. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Taawere ‹Doonzono! eeg k'aluta!› t eti. Doonzonuwere ‹Tuur Demask'o maants amee, k'alo neen b́geyit keewu jamo manoke neesh keewetuwe› bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Shanman goltsatse tuutson bek'o tfalrawotse taanton teshts ashuwots tkisho detsdek't taan jishfere Demask'oyi bobetsi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>«Manoke Hananiy eteef ash iko fa'e b́teshi, Demask'oyitse beyiru Ayhudi jamwotsoke udetso, Muse nemo kottsonat shayiri ashe b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Bí waat t ganok need' dek't ‹Tieshu Sawulo! ni'aawo aani be'e!› taash bíeti, manorun tiaawo b́ bek'i, bínowere tbek'i. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Bíwere hank'o taash bíeti, ‹Nonihotsko Izar Izeweriye bíettso ndanetuwok'o kááwono be'er b́k'aronowere nshishetwok'o shin shino neen marat'ere, <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Man b́k'aluwere bín bek'aat nshishtsotse ash jami shinatse bísh gawu nwotishe. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Eshe and eebi nkotiri? tuur b́shútso s'eer gúpeyowe, nmorratsnowere mashowe.›<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>«Maniyerehakon Iyerusalem maants aanat Ik'i mootse Ik'o tk'onfere tgitsotse t'iwintson bek'o tbek'i. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Doonzonwere taash be'eyat ‹Nee t jangosh n imet gawo bode'awotse nja'arawo káári Iyerusalemitse kee› bí eti <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Taawere hank'o tieti, ‹Doonzono! Ayhudi Ik' k'oni maa mootse neen amants jamwotsi t tiptsok'onat tjot'tsok'o bo botookon danfnee. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Wosh. 7:58</ref> </char></note> N gawu teshtso Ist'ifanos úd'ewor taawere ttookon úd'iruwots ganok need'dek'at bonton keewumanats shiyeyatniye tteshi, botaahono tekotfere b́teshi,› <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Doonzonuwere ‹Wokooke fa'a Ik' ash Woteraw ashuwotsok neen twoshitwotse tuur amee!› bí eti.»<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Romitse shuwets b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Han b́ borfetsosh ash jamwots P'awlos keewiru keewo bok'ebfere boteshi, maniyre hakon bok'aaro eenshdek't, «Hank'o ashaan datsatse t'afuwe! hank'o ashaan kashon beyo bísh geyiratse!» ett bokuhi. <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Bowere kuhefetst botaho shap'fetst shawono darots bobad'ri. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Altsonuwere man b́bek'tsok'on P'awlosi kes' kes'fuwots galots bokindshituwok'o bíazazi, ash ashonwere eegosh hank'o bíats bokúhiruwok'o danosh jod'fetsr aatetuwok'o bíazazi. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Ernmó shaak'on tifde'er jot'osh bok'anefere P'awlos b́ganoke need'iru bali naashosh «Rom dats ash iko tafiyalo njot'etuwok'o neesh faletuwá?» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Bali naashonuwere han b́shishtsok'on alirwok amt «Eeg k'alishe? Ashaan Rom datsi ashe!» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Mansh alirwo P'awlos maants t'int «Ab taash keewwe, nee Rom datsatsi ashneneya?» bíeti, bíwere «Ee taane» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Azazefonuwere «Rom dats ashok'o taaweyosh ay gize tkishi» bíet, P'awloswere «Taayere Rom dats asho woto tdaats shuweyonee» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Mansh bín aatosh k'andek't teshts ashuwots manoor bíyatse k'azbowoki, azazirwonuwere Rom dats asho habliyon b́tipo danb́k'rtsok'on shatb́wtsi.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos ayhudiwotsi mooshiyiruwots shinats b́ t'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Yaatsok'on azaziruwo, ayhudiwots P'awlosi bos'amitso arikon eegosh b́wottsok'o dano b́geyi, mansh kahni naashuwotsnat mooshiruwotsitsi jamwots bokakuweetuwok'o bí azazi, P'awlosnowere bits dek'amt boshinaats bí t'intsi.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>P'awlos moosheyiruwok kakuweetsuwotsi t'iwintsdek't s'iilt «Ti eshuwotso! hambetsish b́ borfetso jam aawo Ik'i shinatse sheeng beyon tbeetsok'o t nibon danfee» bí et. <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>K'eesi naasho Hananiyimó P'awlos noono botogetuwok'o P'awlos ganoke need'iru ashuwotsi bíazazi. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:27-28">Mat. 23:27-28</ref> </char></note> Manoor P'awlos Hananiyish, «Nee nooron futets maa dir artsono! nenowere Ik'o togetuwee! nemok'on tjangosh angshosh beedek'atniya nemalon taan botogetuwok'o niazaziri?»<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Manoke teshts ashuwots P'awlossh «Ik'i kahniwots naashoneya nc'shiri?» boeti.<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kesh. 22:28</ref> </char>
    </note> P'awloswere «Ti eshuwotso! kahaniwotsatsi naasho b́wottsok'o danatse b́teshi, manwere eegoshe ‹Ni ashaatsi naashatse gondo aap'k'aye› etiruwo guut'ere» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Wosh. 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp. 3:5</ref> </char>
    </note> P'awloswere manoke fa'a ashuwotsitse k'atsuwots Seduk'awiya etetsuwotsi k'atsuwotswere feresawi etefuwotsi bo wotok'o dant «Ti eshuwotso! taa feresawi etetswotsatse feresawi taane, hamb! and angsheyiruwo tt'iniye noosh jangit imets k'irotse tuwi jangoshe» ett b́ k'aaro eenshdek't mooshiruwots taalotse b́ keewi.<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>P'awlos han b́ keewutsok'on feresawiyotsnat Seduk'awiya eteefuwots dagotse fayo tuut mooshiruwotsi gitok kay b́k'ri. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat. 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar. 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:17">Luk'. 20:17</ref> </char></note> Seduk'awiya eteefuwots «K'irotse tuwo aaliye, melakiywotswere aalne shayironwere aaliye» boere feresawiyotsmó «Jamanots fa'ane» ettniye boamanefo. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Manoor dimbri eeno wotb́wtsi, ferisawi jirwotsitse ik ik nem danifuwots tuwut «Noo ashaanatse eegoru gond keewo daatsratsone, Shayro wee melakiyo bísh keewure b́wotiti, no eegoru danatsone?» ett bomooshi.<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Fyonuwere kup'efere bíame ashuwots P'awlosn yec' yec'ay tiish ishitune ett shatt azaziruwo «Od'er P'awlosi ashuwots dagotse kishde'er woowere! kes'fuwots galots dek' boami!» et wotaderwotsi bíazazi.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Yatsok'ono t'úwun doonzo P'awlos ganok need'dek't «Shenono! Iyerusalemn taash n gawutsok'o, mannk'o Romits taash gawo neen geyituwe» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlosi úd'osh maletsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Datso b́ gatstsok'on ayhudiyots kakuweewutsat «P'awlosn noo úd'raniyere mááyo máárátsone, aatsono úyatsone» ett botaareyi. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Malaanats shiyeets ashuwots taawonwere haboniyere bogfno boteshi. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Bowere kahni naashuwotsnat eenashuwotsok amt hank'o ett boosh bokeewi «P'awlosi nó úd'raniyere maayo nonots nogerawok'o kup'shdek'at taareerone, <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Mansh it mooshiruwotsnton shiyede'er kúp'de'er bín it aatit keewok'o aride'er P'awlosi itsh bodewetuwok'o azaziruwo aatuwere, noowere hanok b́ boraftsere shinon úd'osh k'andek'rone.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Ernmó P'awlos mish naay mal man b́shishtsotse kes' kes'fuwots galots amkindt P'awlossh b́keewi. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>P'awloswere bali naashuwotsitse iko s'eegdek't «Na'an kes' azaziruwosh b́keewit keewo b́detstsotse bíyokde'er t'ine» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Bali naashonuwere na'aman azaziruwok dek' kindt «Tipetso P'awlos taan s'eegt na'an neesh b́keewit keewo b́detstsotse niyok t t'intsituwok'o taan b́k'oni» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Azaziruwonuwere na'o kisho detsdek't okaan dek'amt, «Taash nkeewituwo eebi?» ett bíaali bíaati.<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Na'onuwere hank'o bíeti, «Ayhudiwots P'awlos keewo katsidek' k'ebiruwok'o araat yaats mooshiruwots shinaanats boosh nt'intsitwok'o neen aatosh ik wotwutserne. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Ernmó boosh eekfne, bín noúd'raawo mááyo máratsone, aatsonowere úyatsone ett taarts haboniyere bogts ashuwots bín úd'osh aashdek'rne, and bo bokotir boosh nkeewituwo s'uziye.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Azaziruwonuwere «Keewan taash n keewutsok'o konshor daniyik'aye» ett na'o deen b́k'ri.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos dats k'eezirwo Filiks shinats b́t'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Maniyere hakon kes' azazefman bali naashwotsitse gituwotsi s'eegdek't «Ilitsi keez sa'ato b́wottsok'on K'isari maants git bal kes'fuwotsnat shab farshetsuwotsi, git bal gin shap'fuwotsnowere k'aniwere, <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>P'awlosshowere farsho it k'anire dats keewiruwok Filksok jeenon b́bodetuwok'o woshwore» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Hank'o etiru woshonowere work'atats guut' b́k'ri, <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«K'elawudiyos Lusyosoke, mangts dats k'eezfo Flkissh! jeeno neesh wotowe! <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Ashaan ayhudiwots detsdek't úd'oshe boteshi, taamo Rom dats ash b́woto tdantsosh kes' kes'fuwotsnton bodat bín t wooriyi. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Eegatse tuutson bos'aamitsok'o danosh geeyat mooshiruwotsok t'intsree b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Bos'amiwere bo nematse tuuts keewon b́wottsok'o tdaatsi, ernmó k'irosh wee tiposh bín betsit keewo aaliye. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Ashaan údosh maletsok'o tshishtsok'on manoor níyok twoshi, s'amiruwotsuwere bíyatse bodetsts s'aamiyo nshinatse bot'intsituwok'o boosh keewure.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Mansh kes'kes'iruwots boon azazetsok'o Pawlosi t'úwon dek'amt Antip'at'risok bobetsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Yatsok'on Farshetsuwots P'awlosn ton boametuwok'o wosht boowere k'es' kes'fuwots gálo maants k'azboaani. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Farshetsuwotsuwere K'isariyo bo bodtsok'on worek'atats guut'ets woshman dats k'eziruwosh imt P'awlosi b́shinats bot'intsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Dats k'ezirowonu worek'atats gút'ets woshman b́nababi hakon P'awlossh Aawoki dats ashnene? ett bíaati, Kilik'iy dats ash b́ woto b́ dantsok'on <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>«Neen s'amiruwots boowor njango shishetuwe» bí eti. Herodis mengst moots b́ koteetuwok'owere bíazazi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Ayhudiwots P'awlosi bo s'aamitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Úúts aawoniyere il kahni naasho Hanani eenash ikikuwotsnat T'ert'elusi eteef Nemo sheengshdek' dantsonton K'isari maants bíami, boowere dats k'eeziruwo Filiksok t'int P'awlosi bo s'aami, <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>P'awlosi s'eegdek't t'intsetsok'on T'ert'elus hank'o eton s'aamiyo dek't b́tuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">«Shiimetso Filikso! niyatse tuwtson ay jeeno daatsrone, n sheeng k'eezonowere noashosh sheeng wonewo daatsere, <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Ayidek'at mangtso Filikso n k'alts sheeng keewan jamoke jam weeron een údone nodek'iri. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Andmó t ja'irawo k'awunon neesh t keewit keewo n doon noon nk'ebetuwok'o neen k'oniruwe, <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Ashaan noosh gondshoodo wotwutsere, datsatse fa'a Ayhudi jamwotsats dimbiro b́tuuziri, noimnetiyatse k'aldek'ets naazrawiwotsi eteefwotsshowere boon jishirwooniye. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6-8"/>Ik' moonowere kimshosh bíetfere bín nodetsi, bíyats not'intsts s'aami jaman ar b́ wottsok'o nee ntookon bín aatr dano falitune.» ik ik bitsuwotsitsere han boyits dabfno [No nemok'on bíyats angsheyish gawurone b́teshi, Ernmó gin jishiruwo Lusyos waat angnon nookishotse fos'dek't bíami, bín s'aamirwotsu níyok boweetwok'o bíazazi] <verse eid="ACT 24:6-8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Ayhudiyots «Jam keewan aree» Etfetst s'amiyosh ik wotbowtsi.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Filiks shinatse keewdek't aani b́dek'tsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Dats k'eeziruwo Filiks b́kishon kolat P'awlos b́ keewitwok'owa bíeti, P'awlos hank'o ett bíaaniy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">«Ay dúrosh datsan keewutso nwoto tdantsosh taan s'amiyets keewosh aani tdek'etuwok'o nshinaats tt'intsor ayidek'at geneeúwefetsatniye, <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Ik' k'onosh Iyerusalem maants ti'amron tatse git aawoniyere b́bowok'o nee ntookon danofalfnee, <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Ik'i mootse wotowa ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse wee kitotse kontonuwor t mooshfere wee asho dimbirosh ttuuzfere taan daatsratsne, <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>And tiats bot'intsts s'amiyosh gawo b́jamon neesh t'intsosh falratsne. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Ernmó han neesh kish kitso shunfee, bo kooti dana bo etiru imnetiyi kayo no nihotsko Izar Izeweri Ik'irwe, Muse nemonat Nebiyiwots mas'aafotse guut'ets jamo amanirwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Bowere bojangirwok'o taawor kaawwotsnat morretsuwots k'irotse botuwitwok'o Ik'on jangirwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Mansha Ik'onat ash shinatse nib s'ayino tdetsetuk'o jamaawo kup'irwe.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>«Iyerusalemitsnowere tkeshiyak ay natuwots bobeshiyakon t jirwotssh tep'wotit gizonat Ik'osh imet mebi gizo dek'at tweyi. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Wosh. 21:17-28</ref> </char></note> Ik'o mootsnowere taan daatstsuwots man tk'alfere, manoori gizeyonuwere s'ayini fino fin tk'rtsok'one, taantonuwere ay asho aaliye b́teshi, dimbironwere tuuratse. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Ernmó Isiyon waats ayhudiwots manoke fa'ane boteshi, bo taan bos'aamit keewo detsfno wotiyal nshinaats t'inr keewune. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Haniyakonowere moosh mooshiyiruwots shinats tt'iinoor t t'afitso fa'ewotiyal t'ints ashaanots keewune. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Wosh. 23:6</ref> </char></note> Arikon bo taalotse need'dek'at ‹K'irtsuwots tuwo fa'e tiettsosh hambets angshosh it shinats t'inre› etaat een k'aaron keewure, haniyere okoon k'osho tk'alts keewo aaliye.»<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Filiksmó Krstiyani imnetiyi jango sheengshdek't b́dantsotse «Kes' azazefo Lusyos b́waatsok'on itjangosh angshituwe» ett boon deenb́k'ri. <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>P'awlosi kotiru bali naashoshowere «Ayide b́ kic'irawonat b́ jaguwotswere bish k'alo bogetso baziyerawon b́kotetuwok'wa» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Fliknat Drusila shinats b́t'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Muk' aawwotsiyere hakon Filkis Dursili eteets b́mááts ayhudiyunton b́weyi, P'awlosnowere s'egiydek't Iyesus Krstos shútson amani jango b́keewufere b́shshi. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>P'awlos kááwu woti jangonat took kewdek'i jango weet angshonowere b́keewor Filiks shatt «And k'ayamee, taash b́k'anoor k'osh aawots neen s'eegituwe» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Filiks P'awlosoke gubo dek'osh jangitniye b́tesh, mansh ayoto P'awlosi s'eegiyir b́keewifoni.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Git natoniyere okoon P'ork'iyos Fist'os Filikis shegro b́beyok b́beeyi, Filiks ayhudiwotsi geneúshosh geeyat P'awlosi b́ tipetsok'on k'azb́k'ri.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Fist'os shinats b́t'iintsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Fist'os bí alguro K'isariyotse kindt keez aawo b́ teshiyakon manokere Iyerusalm maants bíami <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2-3"/>Manoknowere kahni naashwotsnat ik ik een een Ayhudi jirwots Pawlosats bo s'aamiyo bot'intsi, «P'awlosi Iyerusalemi deewáár noosh sheeng keewo k'aluwe» ett bok'oni, han boettsonuwere P'awlosi weerindatse korde'er úd'osh bo geetsotsne. <verse eid="ACT 25:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Fist'osmó «P'awlos K'isariyon tipi mootsne koteyiri, taawere kaari and aanar b́maants ametuwe, <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>It naash naashuwotsuwere taanton K'isariyo maants amnee, P'awlos b́ fints gond fino b́beyal manoke s'amiwune» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fist'os shmt aawoniye wee tats aawoniye bowawu aawwotsi bonton b́ beshiyakon K'isariyo maants no ami, manok nobodtsok'on yaatsok'on naashi jorats bedek't P'awlosi bíyok de'er bot'inetuwok'o bíazazi. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>P'awlos b́ t'intsok'on Iyerusalemn waats ayhudiyots gúrdek't need'at gaawu deshaw ay een een s'amiyotsi bí'ats bot'intsi, <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>P'awloswere «Taa ayhudiyots Nemats wotowa Ik' maats wee Rom nugúsats t fints gond fino aaliye» ett bí'atse bíaniyit keewo b́keewi.<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Fist'osmó ayhudiyotsi geneúsho geeyat P'awlosi «Iyerusalem maants amr han jangosh manoke tshinatse angsho dek'osh geefneya?» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>P'awlosmó hank'o ett bíaani, «Hambe! taa b́shinaatse mooshosh Rom nugúso angshi jori shinatse t need'iri, nee sheengsh dek'at ndantsok'on ayhudiyotsats t fints gond fino aaliye. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Morretso twotiyal wee k'irosh betsit fayo tiats betsit morro finere wotiyal woruna eraatse, ernmó bo s'amiyan k'awuntsalka wotiyalmó konuwor bosh taan beshide'er imo falratse, taa Rom nugúsosh taash s'iilewe etaat t'intsree.»<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Manoor Fist'os bín izfwotsnton keewedek't «Romko nugúso taash s'iile etri wotiyal nugúsok ametunee» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Agrip'nat bernik'e shinats bt'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Muk' aawwotsiyere hakon Nogúso Agrip'nat Bernik'e Fist'ossh «Dan jeenon waarne» etosh K'isari maants boweyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Manoknowere ay aawosh beyat boteshtsosh Fist'os P'awlos jango hank'o ett Nuguso Agrip'sh b́ keewi, «Filks tipk'rat k'az b́k'rts ash iko hanoke fa'e b́teshi, <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Taa Iyerusalemitse tteshor kahni naashuwotsnat Ayhudi eenashuwotsn ashaan bos'amiye hakon bíats t angshituwok'o boaati. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Taamó ‹Ash iko bín s'amiruwots shinats t'inr bín bos'amirumansh b́keewude'aniyere s'amiyetsman beshide'er imo Rom datsatsi ashuwots neemaliye› etaat boosh tiaanyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Mansh ashaan s'amiruwots ko'eyat hanok bowatsok'on ja'araniyere yaatsok'on angshi jorats bedek'at P'awlosi t shinats bot'intsituwok'o ti azazi, <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Bín s'aamirwots keewosh b́ganok need' bodek'tsok'on bí gond fino finere ett tgawtsok'o bín s'amiyosh betsit keew eegonoru bíats t'intsratsne. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Ernmó bínton bomooshiru moosho bo haymanoti jangonat k'irt teshtso P'awlos ‹Kashetsiye› bí etiruwo Iyesus jange. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Taawere hannaari keewo s'ilosh taan b́kic'ire P'awlosi ‹Iyerusalem maants amr bíyoke keewan jango angsho daatso shunfiya?› tieti. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Bímó bí jango Rom nugúsoke bísh s'ileyish geeyat nugúsok taash s'iilewe bíettsosh manok tdaamifetsosh tipi moots b́teshetuwok'o tiazazi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agrip'were Fist'ossh «Taawor ashaan b́keewufere k'ebo geefe» bí eti. Fist'osuwere «Yaats bín k'ebetunee» bíet.<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Mansh yatsok'on Agrip'nat Bernik'e bo naashi taho tahdek't een baatson wotdek't kes'iruwotsatse naashuwotsnat kit kitotsi een een ashuwotsn deneyat waat angshi maa eenots bokindi, maniyere hakon Fist'os P'awlosi b́ s'eegiyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Hank'owere bíeti, «Nugúso Agrip'o! Itwere noonton fa'a ash jametsuwotso! ayhudiwots ‹Ashaan haniyere hakon kashon beyo bísh geyiratse› ett kuhefetst Iyerusalemitse, hanoknowere ti angshituwok'o taan boaattso it bek'iru ashaaniye. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Taayere bíyatse k'irosh bín betsit gond fino daatsratse, bí Rom naashi naashosh ‹t jango taash s'iilewe› bíettsotse hanok woshosh t k'ut'i. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Wotowa eree b́jangosh t doonzsh tguut'etwo daneets keewo deshatse, mansha s'ileyakon tguut'etuwo tdaatsituwok'owa etaat it shinats bítsnor iki Nugúso Agrip'o! nshinaats t'intsree. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Tipetso danbaan dameeyor bí s'amiyets jango kits k'azo dartsi araatniye taash b́be'eyi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Agrip' shinatse b́keewts keewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agrip' P'awlossh, «N took jangosh keewundek'etuok'o taaro neesh imere» bíet, Pawlosuwere b́kisho jargdek't hank'o ett keewut aani b́dek'i.<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>«Nugúso Agrip'o! Ayhudiwots taan bos'aamits keewujamosh hambets nshinatse keewur aani tdek'or ayiniye t geneúwiri. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Bítsnowere nee ayhudiwots niwonat moosh jamo t'iwintsdek'at danfnee, mansh k'amoon taan nk'ebetuwok'o neen k'onirwe.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>«Na'ortson tuwat awuk'o t beetsok'owo ayhudiwots danfnee, shintson tuwat tiash ashi dagotsnat Iyerusalemitse t be beyo danfnee. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Wosh. 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp. 3:5</ref> </char></note> Ando aani gawo bogeyiyal no haymanotiwotse kup'idek'at nonemo kotiru kayuwotsitse ferisawi wotat tbewok'owo shintson detst danfnee. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Andmó angshosh hanok tneed'ir Ik'o nonihotssh taart b́ imts b́ jangiitsoshee. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Jangiyetsanok bodosh no jir tatse gituwots Ik'o t'uwe aawo Ik'ifetstni bokotfo, Nugúsono! taawor ayhudiwotsn taan bos'aamits jangiyetsan jangatsne. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Ik'o k'irtswotsi b́tuuzitwok'o eegoshe itoke amano maawek b́woti?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Wosh. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref> </char>
    </note> «Taa t tookish Nazrettso Iyesus shútso tfaltsok'on k'efo taash geyife etaat asaabefe b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Iyerusalemitse tk'altsonúwere haniye b́teshi, kahni naashuwotsoke t dek'ts alon amantsuwotsitse ayuwots tipimoots bokindituwok'o k'alre, boon boúd'orowere úd'iruwotsnton ik wotere. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Ayoto ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse boon jod'r doonzo boc'ashetuwok'o woshfee, boon ayide fayarnuwere k'osh úratsi kituwotsokor kesh amaat boon giishefe.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Krstos maants awuk'on bíaantsok'owo b́keewutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19:6">Wosh. 9:1—19:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Han jangosho kahni naash jamwotsoke alonat tzaziyo dek'at Demask'o maants tí amifere tteshi. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Nugúsono! weeratse t befere aawu taalon aawu sháánoniyere bogo sháánts shááno tbek'i, sháánanuwere tiyatso taanton sha'irwots gúúratso darotse sháániyi b́k'ri. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Noúnetswere datsats dih s'uwat nobefere ayhudiwots noon keewu keewon ‹Sawul! Sawulo! eegishe taan ngishiri? Shiki shashats nned'iyal neesh b́ gonditi!› etiru k'ááro tshishi. <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Taawere ‹Doonzono! nee kone?› tieti, doozonuwere, taash hank'o bíeti, ‹Taa nee ngishiruwo Iyesus taane. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Andmó tuur n tufoon need'owe, taa neesh tbe'eyiye and taan nbek'tsannat shino maants neesh tbe'et keewosh gútsonat gawo nwotitsh tgetsotsne. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Israe'el ash ashuwotsnat bo maants neen twoshit Ik' danawu ashuwots kishotse neen farituwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Bo aawo n k'eshituwok'onat t'aluwotse shááno maants nkishituwok'o Shed'anosh keeweewotsno Ik'o maants ni aanituwok'o woshituwe, boowere taan bo amantsi jangon bo morrosh orowa eto daatsitune, galdek'etsuwotsnton ritstiyo kaydek'etune.›<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Eshe nugúso Agrip'o! daaratse taash imets bek'osh k'aztso woteratse. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Wosh. 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:28-29">28-29</ref> </char></note> Ernmó shino Demask'on fa'a ashuwotsi, maants dabat Iyerusalemnat Yhud dats jamatse, Ik' danawu ashuwotsi naandrone err Ik'o maants bo aanituwok'o tdaniyi, naandrone boettsok'ono kitsit fino bo finituwok'o boon tdani. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Han jangosh ayhudiyots Ik'i mootse t befere taan detsdek't úd'osh boeti. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Hambetsish b́borfetsosh Ik' tep'o tiyatse k'aleratse, manshe múk'osho enosho gawefetsat hanoke ned'iruwe, nebiyiwotsnat Musen shino hank'o wotituwe boetts keewo keewoniyere okoon k'osho eegoru keewuratse. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 K'or. 15:20</ref> </char></note> Bowere bokeewu ‹Mesihiyo gond bek'o dek'etuwe, k'irotse tuwonowere shintso wotar kashi sháánono Israe'el ashuwotsnat Ik'i ash woterawwotsnsh kitsituwe› ettniye.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>P'awlos man keewoke b́befere Fist'os «P'awloso! ando geewutsernee, ay ndano neen geyomants betsk'rere!» ett kuhat b́keewi.<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>P'awlosmó hank'o ett bíaniyi, «Ayidek' shiimetso Fist'oso! arikonat kaawu keewoni tkeewiri bako geeyaliye tgeyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>B́ shinatse keewan tkeewiru nugúso keewan danfee. Hanwere ashon k'alerawo b́wottsotse nugúso b́dantsok'owo danfee. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Nugúso Agrip'o! nebiyiwotsi amanirunosha? Ni'amaniruwok'o danfee.»<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agrip'were P'awlossh, «Nee k'awun sa'atanitse taan krstiyani woshk'rishale» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>P'awloswere, «K'awun gizewotse wotowa geenz gizewotse n s'uzi b́woterawon hamnbets tkeewuts keewo shishts jamo t tipeyaniyere okoon taank'o bowotish Ik'o k'oniruwe!» bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Haniyere hakon nugúso, altsonat Bernik'ewu bonton bedek't teshts ash jamwots k'az botuwi. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Manoke kesht boamferowe, «Ashaan k'irosh wee tipewosh bín betsituwo eegoru k'alratse» boeti. <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agrip'were Fist'ossh, «Ashaan Rom nugúsoke tkeewo taash s'iilewe eto b́ k'azink'ere hank'on fakshk'ryank'e» bí eti.<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Rom maants b́sha'ats sha'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>It'ali datso maants markabon no ametuwok'owa eteetsok'on P'awlosnat k'osh k'osh tipetswotsn Rom dats k'eeziru Awugst'osi eteetso kes' jishiruwots kayotse teshtso Yuliyosi eteets bali abaatsi naashosh boimi, <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Isiyon aatsi k'ari gúratse markabi bíyok need'irwok amiru Adramit'yon markabats keeshdekat no sha'i, mek'odeni awurajotse fa'a Teselonk'e kitotsi asho Arst'rokoswere nontoniye b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Yaatsok'on Sidoni amnobodi, Yulyus P'awlossh sheengo b́teshtsotse b́ shunfwotsok amt bísh geyit tep'o bish bok'alituwok'owa bí eti. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Manoke tuwatnwere jongo noshinaatse noats b́ jongiruwotse K'op'rositse aats k'aritsi datsu te'o woshdek'at markabatsi sha'o dek'atnotuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Kilk'iyanat P'infiliyo ganoke fa'a aats k'aro nokimiyakon Lik'iyon fa'ú Mura kitto nobodi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Manoke bali abaatse altso It'aliyomants ametuwo Iskndr markabo daatsdek't bíats nokeshetuwok'o b́woshi.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Ay aawo t'awaash dek'at sha'at ay gond bek'on K'enidos kitu ganok amnobodi, jongonwere shinomaants noamawok'o noon b́bazitsotse Selmona dats gúúri ganoke beshat k'ert'es aatson gúrets datsu naaydek'at noami. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Ay gondbek'on gúr gúron nobeshiyakon Lasiy kitu ganoke daatseyiru, «Markabi need'ok sheengi» eteef beyokuk amnobodi.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>No weeratsnowere ay gizewo hank'on b́ís'uure s'oomi gizeyo b́beshtsotse manoor aats k'aratse sha'o ayidek' shatiko b́teshtsotse P'awlos ashuwotssh hank'o ett bo atso bokotetuwok'o b́woshi, <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«It ashuwotso! haniyak nosha'it sha'o shatiyits keewo bítse b́beyok'o taash be'eyiruwe, Kuronat markaboon s'uzats b́woterawo ash kashatsor kup'ts t'afonat s'uwo bodetuwe.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Bali abaatse altsonmó P'awlos izoniyere markabu azaziruwonat markabudoonz boetiruwoni b́ k'ebiri. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Markabwots need'okman jooshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Joosha: </char><char style="ft">Medtrani datsatsi joosho t'k'mtn tuut yekatiti b́ boerfetsoni. </char></note> kimoosh sheengo woto b́k'aztsotse ay ashuwots, «Shinomaants sha'arr faletkawotyal gaar weeron, muur aawukindomantsi fengesho maantse fa'o Fink'eyi eteefo K'ert'esitse markab ned'efok borr manoke joosho beshiwone» ett bo asaabiyo bot'intsi.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aats k'aratse jongi eenon giwits aatso tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Muur maantse muk' jongu b jongefere bobek'tsok'on boasaabtsok'o boosh b́wottsok'o bíarere markab bín bojokiru bitsdek't aatsatse sha'o dek't botuwi, markabi ned'iruwoke tuut k'ert'es ganoke gúr gúron bobeshi. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Ernmó muk'i boteshiyakon, «Gaar maantsi aawu keshon eegurahi jongo» kup'ts jongo aats k'aro bin gúrts datsuatse tuut aats k'aromaants bomaants b́weyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Markabonwere b́gifniyetsonat jongmansh b́maawutsotse s'k etaat jongon jokeyat noami. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>K'eda eteets aats k'aron gúrts datsu naaydek'at nosha'or ay gond bek'on Markabuko jelbo detsdekat nokishots geddek'o nofali. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Markab jookiruwots jelbu markabots geetsdek't bokishiyakon markabu gúridek't jokon bo s'aas'i, markabu Surtisi eteets shiyi datsu maants bdihirawok'o shatt sharo k'o'úbazt jongon jokefere boami. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Egúrahon were kup'efere bíamtsotse yatsok'on markabats kuryets k'ac'o ik ikon aats k'aromaants juwo dek'botuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Keezl aawots markabi k'ac'o bokishon k'aaúdek't shap't bojuwi, <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Ay aawosh aawuno wotowa, k'eeno bo bee'awotse jongonwere kup'efere bíamtsotse haniyere hakon kashosh falatsonee ett maac'o k'ut'bodek'i.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Ashuwots misho b́jamon bomarawo ay aawo boteshi, mansh P'awlos bodagots need'dek't hank'o bíeti, «It ashuwotso! taa tiettso shishat T'ersesn turatste wotink'ere awaashonat t'af jamann itats borawnk'ee b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Andoor markabo s'uzi awaashiti bako ititse konatsor t'afo boratse, mansha shenuwotso shatk'ayere! etaat itn iziruwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Oots t'ú bík twottso bín t Ik'iruwo Izar Izewer b́woshts melakiyo t ganok need'de'k't <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>‹P'awloso! shatk'aye! Romko naashi naasho shinatse need'o neesh geyife! hambe neenton sha'iru jamo Ik'o neesha err k'irotse worituwe› ett taash keewure. <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Manshe it ashuwotso shatk'ayere! Ik'o taash b́keewuts jaman b́jamon b́s'eentsituwok'o bín amaniruwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>B́woteferemó jongo noon aatson gúrts dats ikuk de'amr juuk'rituwe.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Tatse aauwdl t'úwotse Adriyay aats k'ari taalotse jongon jod'efe noamfere taali titson markab jookiruwots datsomants bot'intsok'o boosh bíari. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Mansha aats k'ari woko bín indeef joko dek't boindere dashan b́woko habigit indok'o wotat b́datseyi, muk'i boteshiyakon ando boindere shiits indok'o dashan b́geenztsok'o bodaatsi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Nomarkabo aats k'ari gúúratse fa'a shutsuwotsats b́gawerawok'o shatt markabi shutsomantse markab bín jookef awdwotsi aatsots oorsh bok'ri, maniyere hakon t'úwo beshar bíere aawo boosh b́weetuwok'o Ik' k'ono dek' botuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Markabu jookiruwots markabutse kesht wos'o geeyat boteshtsotse markabu shinomaantse bín need'iyeyiru biro dashan juwiruwo araat markabutse fa'a jelbu aats k'aromaants bojuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Manoor P'awlos bali naashonat kes' kes'fuwotssh «Markabu jokirwots markabatse giwuk'ayr bobeyala bako it faro falratste» bíti. <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Mansh kes' kes'fuwots jelbu detsts joko k'ut'k'raat aatsats juubok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Datso gatsosh bíetfere jametsuwots misho bo meetuwok'o P'awlos k'ont boosh hank'o bíeti «Eegonor mook'zat koto dek' it tuwiyako hamb hambetson tatse awdl aawe. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Manshe maayo it nonots itgedetwok'oye iti tk'oniri. Mannowere faritute, it took s'iirotse ikunwor dats fed'eratsatsane.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Man bietihakon misho k'aaúdek't jamishinaatse Ik'o b́údi, titsdek'tnuwere moo dek'b́tuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Mann jametsuwots kup'at misho bomeyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Markabutse b́ jamon git baalona shabe shrt ashuwotsn fa'ane noteshi. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Jamwots máát boworiyakon Markabats kuriyets Sindeyo aatsi k'aro maats juwat bíyatsi kuro boketi.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Markabo b́tishtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>B́ gatstsok'on bobodoko danatsno botesh, wotowa bako shiyo bítse be'eyiru aatsi k'aro bo bek'i, boosh b́faleyal markabu b́ maants gifnir úratse kishosh bogawi. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Markabo bín bneed'iru bíro bítsdek't aats k'arots faksh bok'iri, manoor bín markabo jokeyiru jokono bítsbok'ri, man kaawats fa'a sharono jongo maants dambaan k'aaúdek't aatsi k'ari gúúro maants keshosh boami. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Ernmó markabu kakuwets shiyats bgaawetsosh dashan gúp'n bwutsi, b́shino maantsno dashan k'ons'ewtsat giwo bk'azti, b́shuutso maantsnomó jongi gifniyatse tuwtson tisho b́tuwi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Tipetswotsitsere ikonuworu wáákr b́keeyawok'o kes' kes'fwots úd'osh bogawi. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Baalats naashonmó P'awlosi oriyosh b́getsotse boetts man de'atse, dab waak faltso shini markabots aatsi k'aro maants t'olar datsats k'ayi bokeshetuwok'o bíazazi.<verse eid="ACT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Oortsuwotsmó Markabi is'uwotsnat markabi tishats bede'er bokeshetuwok'o bíazazi, mank'oon jamwots jeenon datsats bo bodi.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos maltayi eteets aatso bin gúúrts datsuatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>K'aznofariyakon biats nobodts aats gúrdek'ts datsu Maltayi eteefu b wottsok'o dan nok'ri. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Aatson gúrts datsmanatse beyiruwots adits shuno noosh bokitsi, manorowere awusho b́buye ak' b́wottsotse tawo aat'idek't noon s'eeg dek't boibii. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>P'awlos shooto kakudek't taawots b́gedfere, k'ees'manatse tuutson dawunz ik kesht b́kishats deshwutsat joor b́wutsi, <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Malta dats ashuwots dawunzo P'awlos kishats joorat b́befre bek't «Arikon ashaan kash údk ashe! aats k'aratsi jongotse jeenon b́keshalor Izar Izewer angshotse oorat kashon beyo falratse» boeti. <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>P'awlosmó dawunzo taawots tebdek' juuk'rat eegor gondo bín b́datsrawo b́oori. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Ashuwotswere «Andemo andek'úna bíatso b́gaapiti, wee danerawon k'irr b́dihiti» ettni bokotfera botesh. Ernmó ayoto bokore bíats gondo eegoru bodo b́k'aye bobek'tsotse boaasabiyo wonidek't «Hanuwo Izar Izeweriye!» boeti.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Manok noteshts beyok man ganoke aats gúrts dats mani altso puplyus datso fa'e b́tesh, ashaan b́ meyits nondek't keez aawosh sheengshdek't noon b́ ibiyi. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Manoor puplyos nih atsik'es'onat ac'uwoo bín detsbde'e shoodtni b́k'eyiri b́tesh, P'awlos bíyok kindt Ik'o bísh b́k'oni, b́ kishonowere bíats geddek't kashiyib́k'ri. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Man b́wotiyakon aatson gúriyets datsmanatsi k'osh shodetsuwots waat bokashi. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Ash ashuwotswere ime keewo noosh dek't boweyi, noon bomangitsok'onowere noosh bokitsi, markabon amoosh notuworowere noosh geyitu jamo markabats noosh bokuriyi.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos sha'o Maltayiyere Rom maants</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Keez shashosh Maltan noteshiyakon joshman aats kaaron gúrts datsmanatse no beshitso Eskndriyaa markabats keshdek'at notuwi, merkabunu Diyosk'orosi eteetso Woteraw maat ik'wots milkito btookatse detsfe b́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Srakus kitamots no bodtsok'on manoke keez aawo nobeyi. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Mokno aats k'aaro gúúrat Regiyum kitu nobodi, manoke ik aawo nobeshiyakon muur jongo b́ jongtsosh gitl aawots putiyolus maants noami. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Eshumanotsnowere daatsat bonton shawat aawo nobeysh noon bok'oni, maniyere hakono Rom maants noami. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Romitse fa'a amantsuwots nojango boshishtsok'on Afiyos gawuyonat «Keez k'eewokuwotsi» eteefuwotsok b́borfetso noon dek'osh boweyi, P'awlos boon b́bek'tsok'on Ik'o udat kup'b́wutsi.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Romitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Romits nokindtsok'on P'awlosi kotet kes' kes'f iko imt bíyal b́ beetuewk'o wosheyi.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Keez aawoniyere okoon P'awlos Romitse fa'a ayhuditsi een een ashuwotsi b́ s'eegiyi, bokakuwetsok'ono hank'o bíeti, «Tieshuwotso! Israe'el ash ashonat nihwots nemats tk'altso egonuworu gond fino aaliye, wotowa bako Iyerusalemn tipeyat Rom ashuwotssh besheyat ti'imeyi. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Rom ashuwots taan boatiyakon k'irosh taan betsit weero datso bok'aztsotse hank'on taan fakshosh gawtniye boteshi. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Wosh. 25:11</ref> </char></note> Ayhudiyotsmó taa hank'on tfakshewo bok'eftsotse Rom nugusoke taash s'iilewe eto geyik b́woti, b́wotiyaloru ti ashuwotsi ts'aamit keewo deshatseb́teshi. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>And itn ts'egiye itn bek'osh geeyat manowere itsh keewoshe, taa habiliyan ttipe Isra'elsh jangit imets keewi jangoshe.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Bowere hank'o ett bísh boaani, «Yhud datsatse njangosh gúút'ets wosho noosh boratse, hanok waats ashuwotsitse konuworu ngondo keewtso aaliye. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Namaniru haymanotiyan b́ be beyoke ash ashuwots bok'efiruwok'o danfone, mansh níasabtso eeg b́wottsok'o shisho geefone.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Aawo bísh bodetsiyakon aywotdek't b́ beyiru moo maants boweyi, bíwere guurtson kooc'ish b́borfetsosh Ik'i mengsti jangosh gawon bíasabiyo boosh kish b́ kitsi, boon amaniyoshowere Muse nemonat nebiyiwots mas'aafotse kitsfetst Iyesus jangosh boosh b́daniyi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Ik ikuwots b́aap'o boamani, k'oshuwotsmó amaneratsno. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Bowere boatsetseyo ik bowoterawon bok'aleyi. B́wotefere bok'aleyoniyere shino P'awlos b́keewo b́ ishoor hank'o ett b́keewi, «S'ayin shayiro Nebiyiwo Isayasn it nihotssh b́ keewtso arikee b́teshi! <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>B́ keewts aap'o hankowa b́wotiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‹Ash ashaanotsok amrniye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Shishonere shishetute, ernmó t'iwintsratste,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Bek'onere bek'etute, ernmó nibn de'atste eree boosha,<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26-27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Ashaanots nibo kup'wtsere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Bowaazonuwere ipewutsere, boaawonuwere is'ewutsere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Hnk'o wotob́k'azink'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Bo aawon be'er,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Bowaazon shide'er,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Bonibonowere t'iwintsde'er</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Tmaants bo aanere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Taawere boon tkashyank'oni b́teshi.› »<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>«Eshe Ik'i kashiyi wosho Ik'i ash woterawwotssh woshetsok'owo dande'ere, boowere eekar bín dek'etune. <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>[P'awlos han b́keewiyakon ayhudiwots k'up'shdek't mooshfere manoke kesht boami.]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft">Ik ik bitsuwots 29 taawatstsahan dabrakne. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>P'awlos b́kirayits mootse gitnati s'eeno b́beeyi, b́maants weyiru ashjamwotsno dek'fee b́teshi, <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Ik'i mengstonowere nabfetst doonzo Iyesus Krstos jango konuwor bín b́bazirawon ááwu shuk'on b́danifoni b́teshi.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
